       (12, 1, 1, N'She can send people to their destination with the', 1),
       (12, 1, 2, N'speed of thought!', 1),
       (12, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (12, 1, 5, N'Gate Master Miko is around city central', 34),
       (12, 1, 6, N'He can be found at <7937, 14488>.', 34),
       (12, 1, 7, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (12, 7, 0, N'Well, finally! It''s nice to meet you at last.', 1),
       (12, 7, 1, N'Doesn''t it feel weird that I already know you?', 1),
       (12, 7, 2, N'I have many of sources information.', 1),
       (12, 7, 3, N'Ah yes! I''m Gate Master Miko.', 1),
       (12, 7, 4, N'I can send you off to any destination.', 27),
       (12, 7, 5, N'On top that, I also run a pawn shop. Its similar', 2),
       (12, 7, 6, N'to the warehouse, but its a public warehouse', 2),
       (12, 7, 7, N'for all characters on the same account.', 2),
       (12, 7, 8, N'Nifty, hu? I also used to charge for my services,', 1),
       (12, 7, 9, N'but now the Guardian is subsidizing all costs.', 1),
       (12, 7, 10, N'Don''t be afraid to come to me if you need help!', 1),
       (12, 9, 0, N'Oh hey there! You''re quite the trend-setter.', 1),
       (12, 9, 1, N'Come by my shop and I''ll show you around town!', 1),
       (13, 0, 0, N'Dang! What terrible weather this is!', 1),
       (13, 0, 1, N'Oh, hi, you finally arrived! The town is abuzz', 1),
       (13, 0, 2, N'about you! I''m Kew, the local blacksmith.', 27),
       (13, 0, 3, N'I sell, enchant, and combine weapons.', 1),
       (13, 0, 4, N'I can do much more! But let''s talk another time.', 1),
       (13, 0, 5, N'Well, do you want to meet Deison?', 1),
       (13, 0, 6, N'He may be in the city to the South if not in the', 1),
       (13, 0, 7, N'tarvern. Nice meeting ya though!', 1),
       (13, 1, 0, N'Elder Deison is in Ling Chi Fortress to the South', 2),
       (13, 1, 1, N'He has superb Martial Arts skills.', 1),
       (13, 1, 2, N'He is one of our Martial Masters from way back.', 1),
       (13, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (13, 1, 6, N'Elder Deison is in Ling Chi Fortress to the South', 34),
       (13, 1, 7, N'He can be found at <8294, 15872>.', 34),
       (13, 1, 8, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (13, 7, 0, N'Are you the new disciple?', 1),
       (13, 7, 1, N'Now listen here. The Guardian is busy.', 1),
       (13, 7, 2, N'I will be in charge of your training for now.', 27),
       (13, 7, 3, N'I''m Deison, the Faction''s Lightbringer.', 1),
       (13, 7, 4, N'You have such potential at a rather young age.', 1),
       (13, 7, 5, N'Not bad, perhaps the younger generation will ', 1),
       (13, 7, 6, N'surpass the their senior.', 1),
       (13, 9, 0, N'Hey! Come here, haha.', 1),
       (13, 9, 1, N'Faster, I haven''t much time, honestly!', 1),
       (14, 0, 0, N'Hi, let me introduce myself. I''m the doctor.', 1),
       (14, 0, 1, N'Herbalist Chang.', 1),
       (14, 0, 2, N'I sell remedies and Return Scrolls.', 27),
       (14, 0, 3, N'Since you''re here, you will see me quite often.', 27),
       (14, 0, 4, N'Do you want to meet Fashu? Have you met him yet?', 1),
       (14, 0, 5, N'He is our Guard Captain.', 1),
       (14, 1, 0, N'Fashu is at the city''s North Gate. He does', 2),
       (14, 1, 1, N'a lot of work. He must get tired transporting', 1),
       (14, 1, 2, N'people. I believe he is very experienced!', 1),
       (14, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (14, 1, 5, N'Guard Captain Fashu is at the city''s North Gate. ', 34),
       (14, 1, 6, N'He can be found at <8021, 12714>.', 34),
       (14, 1, 7, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 34),
       (14, 7, 0, N'Hi, I''m Fashu. The Royal Guard Captain.', 27),
       (14, 7, 1, N'Through me, you can help the Faction out by', 27),
       (14, 7, 2, N'participating in Battle Grounds and the like.', 27),
       (14, 7, 3, N'Just like the Gate Masters, I can take you', 1),
       (14, 7, 4, N'to the battlefield instantaneously. In the ', 1),
       (14, 7, 5, N'future I may also assign you tours of duty.', 1),
       (14, 7, 6, N'That''s it. You can go about your business now.', 1),
       (14, 7, 7, N'See you later, bye.', 1),
       (14, 9, 0, N'Come to me.', 1),
       (14, 9, 1, N'Guard Captain Fashu wants to see you, haha.', 1),
       (15, 0, 0, N'Wow, you''re lightning quick! I''ll give you a job', 1),
       (15, 0, 1, N'just as quick as you are, OK? I said don''t panic!', 1),
       (15, 0, 2, N'Anxious one, aren''t you... geesh... anhow.', 1),
       (15, 0, 3, N'''Kobolds'' are patrolling the gates of Ling Chi', 2),
       (15, 0, 4, N'Fortress. Go there and kill one. Blasted pests', 2),
       (15, 0, 5, N'always saunter up and down the road. As if they', 2),
       (15, 0, 6, N'pose much of a threat to our mighty soldiers!', 1),
       (15, 0, 7, N'Finish them. Report to me once you''ve completed', 1),
       (15, 0, 8, N'your assigned task.', 1),
       (15, 1, 0, N'''Kobolds'' are outside Ling Chi Fortress. They''re ', 2),
       (15, 1, 1, N'easy prey, so you shouldn''t have any trouble.', 2),
       (15, 1, 2, N'Just one will do. Capable people like yourself', 1),
       (15, 1, 3, N'shouldn''t have a problem. Report back when', 1),
       (15, 1, 4, N'the mission has been completed.', 1),
       (15, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (15, 1, 6, N'''Kobolds'' are near Ling Chi Fortress!', 34),
       (15, 1, 7, N'Check the area to the North Gate <8297, 11592>', 34),
       (15, 1, 8, N'Check the area to the West Gate <5478, 13553>', 34),
       (15, 1, 9, N'Check the area to the East Gate <11140, 13526>', 34),
       (15, 1, 10, N'You should locate them easily.', 34),
       (15, 7, 0, N'There you are! Just like I expected. To the ''T''!', 1),
       (15, 7, 1, N'So how was it? Does it feel great to control the', 1),
       (15, 7, 2, N'life of an enemy? You will surely get better.', 1),
       (15, 7, 3, N'Additionally, after every kill you will get more', 1),
       (15, 7, 4, N'and more experience in doing so. Soon you''ll be', 1),
       (15, 7, 5, N'a professional fighter. As your "Level" is a', 1),
       (15, 7, 6, N'ranking within the Faction, you''ll get a new job', 1),
       (15, 7, 7, N'every other level. You''re next expected job would', 1),
       (15, 7, 8, N'be when you reach level 4. It is our intention to', 1),
       (15, 7, 9, N'your capability. As your strength grows, so', 1),
       (15, 7, 10, N'will the difficulty of your missions. It will', 1),
       (15, 7, 11, N'help you to improve yourself gradually!', 1),
       (15, 9, 0, N'Can you come to my place once more?', 1),
       (15, 9, 1, N'I have to test you.', 1),
       (15, 9, 2, N'Do not worry, it won''t be too difficult.', 1),
       (16, 0, 0, N'So, we meet again. You have come just in time.', 1),
       (16, 0, 1, N'Can you go to Agent Kiang and pick up my Holy', 1),
       (16, 0, 2, N'Iron please? Now that the Nangin''s challenge', 1),
       (16, 0, 3, N'has entered the final stage, a lot of weapons', 27),
       (16, 0, 4, N'still need to be made. That requires lots of', 27),
       (16, 0, 5, N'materials, most of which are already ordered from', 1),
       (16, 0, 6, N'him but just need to be collected.', 1),
       (16, 0, 7, N'Sorry, I''ve just been really tied up lately...', 1),
       (16, 1, 0, N'Agent Kiang is at Ling Chi Fortress''s East Gate.', 2),
       (16, 1, 1, N'Just pay him a visit and get Holy Iron.', 1),
       (16, 1, 2, N'Thank you.', 1),
       (16, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (16, 1, 7, N'Agent Kiang is at Ling Chi Fortress''s East Gate. ', 34),
       (16, 1, 8, N'He''s waiting at <9160, 13610>.', 34),
       (16, 1, 9, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (16, 2, 0, N'Haha, are you here for the Holy Iron?', 1),
       (16, 2, 1, N'Such a lazy guy sending other''s in his place...', 1),
       (16, 2, 2, N'Take it, it''s not a big deal.', 1),
       (16, 2, 3, N'What? You don''t know me?', 2),
       (16, 2, 4, N'Have I not introduced myself?', 1),
       (16, 2, 5, N'I''m the most reputable agent in China!', 27),
       (16, 2, 6, N'Agent Kiang, I run the business here.', 27),
       (16, 2, 7, N'Come to me if you have anything to entrust.', 27),
       (16, 2, 8, N'I can handle it for you.', 27),
       (16, 7, 0, N'Wow! well done!', 1),
       (16, 7, 1, N'Thank you very much, haha.', 1),
       (16, 7, 2, N'I will make your equipment some other day,', 1),
       (16, 7, 3, N'just wait and see! It''ll be fantastic!', 1),
       (16, 9, 0, N'Hey, come to my place!', 1),
       (16, 9, 1, N'Get something from Agent Kiang for me please?', 1),
       (17, 0, 0, N'You did great last time, so I come to you again.', 1),
       (17, 0, 1, N'I hope you can do away with some', 1),
       (17, 0, 2, N'''Draconic Cultists'' please? They''re the ones with', 1),
       (17, 0, 3, N'sythe-like claws near the Kobolds. If you do it,', 27),
       (17, 0, 4, N'come to me. Annihilate 5 of them.', 1),
       (17, 1, 0, N'Kill 5 Draconic Cultists,', 2),
       (17, 1, 1, N'Find them where you found the Kobold.', 1),
       (17, 1, 2, N'You can handle it surely.', 1),
       (17, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (17, 1, 6, N'''Draconic Cultists'' are near Ling Chi Fortress.', 34),
       (17, 1, 7, N'Towards the North <8012, 10536>', 34),
       (17, 1, 8, N'Towards the West <4639, 13631>', 34),
       (17, 1, 9, N'Towards the East <11559, 13182>', 34),
       (17, 1, 10, N'You will find them easily.', 34),
       (17, 1, 11, N'You can finish them quicker if you learn an', 34),
       (17, 1, 12, N'"Area Attack" from one of the Master Trainers.', 34),
       (17, 7, 0, N'You did it.', 1),
       (17, 7, 1, N'Guild Director Koh made a great choice!', 1),
       (17, 7, 2, N'If your performance is getting better,', 1),
       (17, 7, 3, N'you will become famous one day!', 2),
       (17, 7, 4, N'Area attacks can slaughter many foes at once!', 27),
       (17, 9, 0, N'Can you spare me a moment?', 1),
       (17, 9, 1, N'I want you to deal with these pesky', 1),
       (17, 9, 2, N'Draconic Cultists! I can''t pick up supplies!', 1),
       (18, 0, 0, N'This is a request from Elder Deison.', 1),
       (18, 0, 1, N'Brigands have started to make trouble', 1),
       (18, 0, 2, N'for us. They ambush citizens on their daily route', 1),
       (18, 0, 3, N'to Ling Chi Fortress and cause anarchy!', 1),
       (18, 0, 4, N'It''s so distressing to see people fall victim.', 1),
       (18, 0, 5, N'Well not anymore! Deison wishes someone can deal', 1),
       (18, 0, 6, N'with this menace, and I think you''re the best', 1),
       (18, 0, 7, N'choice. So go out and eradicate the lot of them!', 1),
       (18, 0, 8, N'They''re basecamp is around the Necromantic Monks.', 1),
       (18, 0, 9, N'Maybe they''re in league, eh?', 2),
       (18, 1, 0, N'Kill 3 Brigands.', 2),
       (18, 1, 1, N'They reside near the Necromantic Monks.', 1),
       (18, 1, 2, N'They will attack from a distance, so be careful!', 1),
       (18, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 1),
       (18, 1, 5, N'''Brigands'' are in Ling Chi Fortress area', 30),
       (18, 1, 6, N'Towards the West <3193, 13053>', 34),
       (18, 1, 7, N'Towards the North <8167, 9051>', 34),
       (18, 1, 8, N'Towards the East <11107, 11433>', 34),
       (18, 1, 9, N'You will find them easily.', 34),
       (18, 1, 10, N'They will attack from a distance, so be careful.', 34),
       (18, 7, 0, N'Sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (18, 7, 1, N'Frankly speaking, its not easy to kill Brigands.', 1),
       (18, 7, 2, N'I will pass this message to Elder Deison.', 1),
       (18, 7, 3, N'Please have a good rest.', 1);
INSERT INTO world.QuestSpeeches (QuestId, SpeechKind, LineIndex, Text, Color)
VALUES (18, 9, 0, N'Would you like to come to my place?', 1),
       (18, 9, 1, N'Our town is experiencing some trouble...', 1),
       (18, 9, 2, N'I hope you can help us.', 1),
       (19, 0, 0, N'Hey. It''s been a long time, I''m Beggar Wung.', 1),
       (19, 0, 1, N'I want to eat some fish. Do you want some too?', 1),
       (19, 0, 2, N'I know a great fishing spot! There are fish', 1),
       (19, 0, 3, N'called ''Dragon Fish''. Mutated creatures of the ', 1),
       (19, 0, 4, N'war I''m afraid,  but none the less tastey to a ', 1),
       (19, 0, 5, N'Beggar! Can you please catch 10 Dragon Fish for ', 27),
       (19, 0, 6, N'me, so that I may make a meal? I would be ', 27),
       (19, 0, 7, N'indebted to you kind person...!', 1),
       (19, 1, 0, N'Please kill 10 Dragon Fish for me,', 1),
       (19, 1, 1, N'Go past where the Draconic Cultists live and', 1),
       (19, 1, 2, N'you will find their nests!', 1),
       (19, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (19, 1, 5, N'''Dragon Fish'' are in the Ling Chi Fortress area', 34),
       (19, 1, 6, N'Towards the West <3403, 13129>', 34),
       (19, 1, 7, N'Towards the North <8240, 9260>', 34),
       (19, 1, 8, N'Towards the East <11133, 11864>', 34),
       (19, 1, 9, N'You will find them easily.', 34),
       (19, 1, 10, N'Finish the mission by catching 10 Dragon Fish.', 34),
       (19, 7, 0, N'Aha! Thank you! Thank you so very much!', 1),
       (19, 7, 1, N'Now I can eat! Thank the heavens!', 1),
       (19, 7, 2, N'Once again, thank you kind person!', 1),
       (19, 9, 0, N'Young man? Or are you a young lady? Can you', 1),
       (19, 9, 1, N'visit me for a moment? You see... I''m quite', 1),
       (19, 9, 2, N'famished, and with all the dangers, I can''t hunt.', 1),
       (20, 0, 0, N'Huh, how are you? Have you been practicing?', 1),
       (20, 0, 1, N'Haha you''re getting stronger!', 1),
       (20, 0, 2, N'By the way, Beitan is looking for you.', 27),
       (20, 0, 3, N'He probably needs your help, you know we are', 1),
       (20, 0, 4, N'short of hands. Just go and find him.', 1),
       (20, 0, 5, N'Search around the Palace,', 1),
       (20, 0, 6, N'you can find him easily.', 2),
       (20, 1, 0, N'Katana Tutor Beitan is near the Palace door.', 1),
       (20, 1, 1, N'Search around the building and you can spot', 1),
       (20, 1, 2, N'him at his normal post.', 1),
       (20, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (20, 1, 5, N'Katana Tutor Beitan is in Ling Chi Fortress to', 34),
       (20, 1, 6, N'the South near the Palace.', 34),
       (20, 1, 7, N'** Special Coordinates **', 1),
       (20, 1, 8, N'Ling Chi Fortress South <8296, 15757>.', 1),
       (20, 7, 0, N'I''m Katana Tutor Beitan, Instructor of the', 1),
       (20, 7, 1, N'art of the Katana. Standing proud beside me are ', 1),
       (20, 7, 2, N'Instructor Twinblade Phong, teacher', 1),
       (20, 7, 3, N'of the Double Blades, and the ravishing Songsmith', 1),
       (20, 7, 4, N'Seiren, Lute Master and deputy to Guardian ', 1),
       (20, 7, 5, N'Fohchoy. Keep in mind that Katanas are for ', 1),
       (20, 7, 6, N'striking but the blades are meant for protecting.', 1),
       (20, 7, 7, N'The Lute however is beautiful, yet dangerous. ', 1),
       (20, 7, 8, N'As sound travels over land, so can their attacks.', 1),
       (20, 7, 9, N'Now you must devote yourself to a teaching that ', 1),
       (20, 7, 10, N'most interests you and you alone.', 27),
       (20, 7, 12, N'~~~~~', 30),
       (20, 7, 13, N'The "New Player Introduction" has been completed.', 34),
       (20, 7, 14, N'Normal missions start at level 14.', 34),
       (20, 9, 0, N'Young warrior, come over quickly.', 1),
       (20, 9, 1, N'I have something for you. its a big opportunity.', 1),
       (20, 9, 2, N'Come over quickly!', 1),
       (21, 0, 0, N'Hi,I''m Guild Director Joh.', 1),
       (21, 0, 1, N'Nice to meet you.', 1),
       (21, 0, 2, N'I''m here to help. Because you''re new here, you', 1),
       (21, 0, 3, N'probably aren''t familiar with how things work.', 1),
       (21, 0, 4, N'I''m responsible for keeping items for citizens', 1),
       (21, 0, 5, N'of the Jinong, in short, the Banker. I also', 27),
       (21, 0, 6, N'do other miscellaneous jobs relating to the', 1),
       (21, 0, 7, N'Faction. When you tour around Ronyan Fortress,', 1),
       (21, 0, 8, N'you''ll meet some rough looking guys. They are', 1),
       (21, 0, 9, N'old timers, and though they may say some', 1),
       (21, 0, 10, N'harsh words, please don''t take it personally.', 2),
       (21, 0, 11, N'By the way, Beggar Domgi is looking for you,', 1),
       (21, 0, 12, N'I hope you can afford the time to meet him.', 1),
       (21, 1, 0, N'Beggar Domgi is at Ronyan Fortress''s North Gate.', 2),
       (21, 1, 1, N'Although he''s a beggar, he is a real master.', 1),
       (21, 1, 2, N'It would be good to make friends with him.', 1),
       (21, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (21, 1, 6, N'Beggar Domgi is at Ronyan Fortress''s North Gate. ', 34),
       (21, 1, 7, N'He can be found at <8417, 17075>.', 34),
       (21, 1, 8, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (21, 7, 0, N'Haha, are you the one mentioned by Guild', 1),
       (21, 7, 1, N'Director Joh? I''ve been poor since I was ', 1),
       (21, 7, 2, N'born. Although I''m a beggar, I learn a ', 1),
       (21, 7, 3, N'lot by observing others.', 1),
       (21, 7, 4, N'Therefore, other than begging,', 1),
       (21, 7, 5, N'I can adjust the grade of equipment.', 1),
       (21, 7, 6, N'Come to me in case you need my help.', 1),
       (21, 9, 0, N'Can you spare a moment?', 1),
       (21, 9, 1, N'Please come over, I have something to tell you.', 1),
       (21, 9, 2, N'Check the city map carefully, you''ll find me!', 1),
       (22, 0, 0, N'Aha, we meet for the first time.', 1),
       (22, 0, 1, N'I''m Tailor Vehl Kei, the shop owner.', 1),
       (22, 0, 2, N'I run the tailor shop for the Jinong.', 27),
       (22, 0, 3, N'Guild Director Joh wanted me to greet you.', 1),
       (22, 0, 4, N'Thanks for coming. I''m really glad to see you!', 1),
       (22, 0, 5, N'By the way, Gate Master Tai is looking for you...', 1),
       (22, 0, 6, N'Can you take some time to find him?', 1),
       (22, 0, 7, N'Gate Master Tai is around the city''s East Gate.', 1),
       (22, 1, 0, N'Gate Master Tai is around Ronyan Fortress''s ', 2),
       (22, 1, 1, N'East Gate. He''s a master at making charms.', 1),
       (22, 1, 2, N'Most moving charms in China are made by', 1),
       (22, 1, 3, N'Tai.', 1),
       (22, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (22, 1, 6, N'Gate Master Tai is around the city''s East Gate.', 34),
       (22, 1, 7, N'He''s waiting at coordinates <9846, 18227>.', 34),
       (22, 1, 8, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (22, 7, 0, N'Hahaha! Are you the rookie?', 1),
       (22, 7, 1, N'I heard about you from that Banker. Whatever.', 1),
       (22, 7, 2, N'I''m Gate Master Tai.', 1),
       (22, 7, 3, N'For a... Small fee, I can send you anywhere, heh.', 27),
       (22, 7, 4, N'Oh yes! I also the a pawn shop here. Its similar', 2),
       (22, 7, 5, N'to the warehouse, but its a public warehouse', 2),
       (22, 7, 6, N'for all characters on the same account.', 2),
       (22, 7, 7, N'I used to charge fees before, but now its free!', 1),
       (22, 7, 8, N'Shh, hush my darling, don''t ask!', 1),
       (22, 7, 9, N'Don''t be a stranger now, OK?', 1),
       (22, 9, 0, N'Would you like to come to my tailor shop? New', 1),
       (22, 9, 1, N'inventory! Come before it''s all gone!', 1),
       (23, 0, 0, N'Humph, huh! Are you the one mentioned by that', 1),
       (23, 0, 1, N'bastard Banker? Nice to meet you. I guess.', 27),
       (23, 0, 2, N'I''m Rhu, a blacksmith.', 27),
       (23, 0, 3, N'I sell, enchant, and combine weapons.', 1),
       (23, 0, 4, N'I can do much more! But let''s talk another time.', 1),
       (23, 0, 5, N'Well, would you like to meet Elder Sha-Tian?', 1),
       (23, 0, 6, N'Fine, be at way. He is in the city, to the South.', 1),
       (23, 0, 7, N'Now go!', 1),
       (23, 1, 0, N'Elder Sha-Tian is in Ronyan Fortress, Soth.', 2),
       (23, 1, 1, N'He is a Jinong General Guardian,', 1),
       (23, 1, 2, N'so you should salute when you see him!', 1),
       (23, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (23, 1, 5, N'Elder Sha-Tian is in Ronyan Fortress to the South', 34),
       (23, 1, 6, N'He can be found at <8757, 19487>.', 34),
       (23, 1, 7, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (23, 7, 0, N'So, you seek enlightenment? I have been', 1),
       (23, 7, 1, N'waiting for you. I''m the Jinong''s', 27),
       (23, 7, 2, N'General Guardian. Elder Sha-Tian.', 27),
       (23, 7, 3, N'Now! Don''t be afraid! Stand at attention! ', 1),
       (23, 7, 4, N'There! I hope you will be to contribute', 1),
       (23, 7, 5, N'much to the Faction... we don''t need another', 1),
       (23, 7, 6, N'worthless Chersieu around.', 1),
       (23, 9, 0, N'Hey! Come here. Haha.', 1),
       (23, 9, 1, N'Come over quickly, dang, I can''t wait!', 1),
       (24, 0, 0, N'Let me introduce myself. I''m the doctor for the ', 1),
       (24, 0, 1, N'Jinong, Herbalist Yucha.', 1),
       (24, 0, 2, N'I sell remedies and Return Scrolls.', 1),
       (24, 0, 3, N'Since you''re here, you will see me quite often.', 27),
       (24, 0, 4, N'By the way, do you want to meet Tuo?', 27),
       (24, 0, 5, N'He is our Guard Captain.', 2),
       (24, 1, 0, N'Tuo is near the city''s North Gate. He does', 2),
