       (45, 1, 11, N'Bucket Soldiers. Those foes will not provide', 1),
       (45, 1, 12, N'Experience and items. Only attack these', 1),
       (45, 1, 13, N'enemies when you have a mission to do so.', 1),
       (45, 7, 0, N'Haha, you''re getting stronger each day.', 1),
       (45, 7, 1, N'They betrayed us this time...well, maybe...Sorry', 1),
       (45, 7, 2, N' for troubling you, this is an enchant material ', 1),
       (45, 7, 3, N'called Tin. It''s used for reinforcing', 1),
       (45, 7, 4, N'equipment! Hope it will do something for you.', 1),
       (45, 9, 0, N'Hey! Something happened! Can you come over?', 1),
       (45, 9, 1, N'Here comes Bucket Mask Sergeants again!', 1),
       (45, 9, 2, N'It maybe a tough battle for you.', 1),
