       (46, 9, 1, N'over fast. Don''t forget the present.', 1),
       (47, 0, 0, N'You should know something about ''Kvetch''.', 1),
       (47, 0, 1, N'Although they only ranked 9 among 10 of the', 1),
       (47, 0, 2, N'minons left by the Nangin, they are not easy to', 1),
       (47, 0, 3, N'deal with for ordinary people. The they usually', 1),
       (47, 0, 4, N'appear in the South,around temples in', 2),
       (47, 0, 5, N'Gocheon Island. During this war period, we are', 2),
       (47, 0, 6, N'really short handed, so we can only count on you.', 1),
       (47, 0, 7, N'Are you complaining about being too tired?', 1),
       (47, 0, 8, N'This is an order, there is nothing I can do.', 1),
