       (52, 0, 1, N'clam down, dont get so angry! Lately, the', 1),
       (52, 0, 2, N'Dreadlords in Maze of Diomas have betrayed us.', 1),
       (52, 0, 3, N'They are calling themselves the Shadowlords.', 1),
       (52, 0, 4, N'They want to attack us. Humph, those creatures...', 27),
