       (53, 1, 12, N'win the battle if you can, survive till all', 1),
       (53, 1, 13, N'enemies are killed.', 1),
       (53, 7, 0, N'Wow! Great.', 1),
       (53, 7, 1, N'In fact, I wasn''t expecting much from you, but', 1),
       (53, 7, 2, N'you did great! Well, did you hear the news?', 1),
       (53, 7, 3, N'Lately, there has come a powerful man to our', 27),
       (53, 7, 4, N'area! I don''t know which one of you two is ', 27),
       (53, 7, 5, N'better? You will face him one day.', 27),
       (53, 7, 6, N'Hahaha! I believe you''re the better one!', 27),
       (53, 7, 7, N'Don''t worry. You''ll beat him!', 1),
       (53, 8, 0, N'Gee, a loser,', 1),
       (53, 8, 1, N'never mind, I will find someone else.', 27),
       (53, 9, 0, N'Help me out! I need hands! Well? Just for your', 1),
       (53, 9, 1, N'information, you will be rewarded!', 1),
