       (54, 1, 0, N'Fighting Aryas are mixed with the Furious Blades ', 1),
       (54, 1, 1, N'of Gocheon Island. You will find them North East.', 1),
       (54, 1, 2, N'Don''t be cheated by their appearance.', 2),
       (54, 1, 3, N'Come back to my place after you finished the', 2),
       (54, 1, 4, N'Fighting Aryas.', 1),
       (54, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (54, 1, 7, N'Fighting Aryas look like the Furious Blades.', 34),
