       (54, 1, 10, N'Coordinates <13985, 6432>. They are mixed', 34),
       (54, 1, 11, N'with the Furious Blades, search carefully.', 1),
       (54, 7, 0, N'Haha, You have a well deserved reputation! I ', 1),
       (54, 7, 1, N'didn''t expect you to finish! Not bad. The bet is', 1),
       (54, 7, 2, N'not much, but a gamble is not valued by the bet.', 1),
       (54, 7, 3, N'Here, this is a Fortune Pouch. If you use it,', 1),
