       (74, 7, 0, N'Huh, I got it.', 1),
       (74, 7, 1, N'I will issue the order, tell everyone to be ', 1),
       (74, 7, 2, N'alert. Oh, tell this to Lupai. The Nangin', 1),
       (74, 7, 3, N'have returned and are now active, tell everyone', 1),
       (74, 7, 4, N'to watch out. I have a bad feeling there will be', 27),
       (74, 7, 5, N'even greater challenges ahead...', 27),
