       (75, 0, 1, N'some unusual activities. Are they going to attack', 1),
       (75, 0, 2, N'Kailan Fortress while Elder Chong remains', 1),
       (75, 0, 3, N'wounded? You have to suppress them, it''s', 1),
       (75, 0, 4, N'better to react before they do. They usually', 1),
       (75, 0, 5, N'appear in Ziming Plains to the North.', 1),
       (75, 0, 6, N'Killing 40 of them will do.', 1),
       (75, 1, 0, N'They are at in Ziming Plains', 1),
       (75, 1, 1, N'to the North. Kill 40 of them. It''s better to', 1),
       (75, 1, 2, N'react before they do.', 1),
       (75, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (75, 1, 6, N'''Clawed Arm Mutant'' are in Ziming Plains', 34),
       (75, 1, 7, N'area to the North - <3686, 3349>', 34),
       (75, 1, 8, N'You will find them.', 34),
       (75, 7, 0, N'I''m sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (75, 7, 1, N'Elder Chong is getting better now.', 1),
       (75, 7, 2, N'You heard the news? Ehlec Teroh has returned with', 27),
       (75, 7, 3, N'the Nangin. I thought it was a terrible rumor... ', 1),
       (75, 7, 4, N'how can there be such a powerful Faction', 27),
       (75, 7, 5, N'that can defeat us so easily? All three Factions', 1),
