       (75, 9, 1, N'Clawed Arm Mutant showed up in Ziming Plains ', 1),
       (75, 9, 2, N'to the North. You must be careful this time!', 1),
       (76, 0, 0, N'Although Elder Chong is getting better, he still', 1),
       (76, 0, 1, N'needs rest. But now Reapers of Hell are starting', 1),
       (76, 0, 2, N'to be troublesome! I hope you can take care of ', 1),
