       (76, 0, 6, N'warn them. Huh, you can go with your friends if', 1),
       (76, 0, 7, N'you have concerns.', 1),
       (76, 1, 0, N'They are hiding in the Ziming Plains and the', 2),
       (76, 1, 1, N'Huni Cave area. They are not very active now,', 1),
       (76, 1, 2, N'you should go there and kill one of them, just to', 1),
       (76, 1, 3, N'warn them. You should go with your friends.', 30),
       (76, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (76, 1, 5, N'Reapers of Hell are unique, they aren''t social.', 34),
       (76, 1, 6, N'They are in Ziming Plains to the North.', 34),
       (76, 1, 7, N'Be careful, they are powerful.', 34),
       (76, 1, 8, N'You may abandon the mission if you wish to.', 1),
       (76, 7, 0, N'You defeated Reapers of Hell?', 1),
       (76, 7, 1, N'They are horrible foes...You''re more powerful', 1),
       (76, 7, 2, N'than I thought. Well, Elder Chong surprised me', 1),
       (76, 7, 3, N'with his injury. If he had not attacked', 27),
       (76, 7, 4, N'Ehlec Teroh with full strength, but conserved', 1),
       (76, 7, 5, N'his protective energy, the result could', 1),
       (76, 7, 6, N'have been different. Anyway, he is better now,', 1),
       (76, 7, 7, N'but still, he was too careless.', 1),
       (76, 8, 0, N'That''s it,', 1),
       (76, 8, 1, N'You go back and have some rest.', 1),
       (76, 9, 0, N'I''m sorry, can you help me out. Reapers of Hell', 1),
       (76, 9, 1, N'are involved in some unusual activities.', 1),
       (76, 9, 2, N'Uh, you should go there and check it out.', 1),
       (77, 0, 0, N'Our Guardian came to me two days ago asking me to', 1),
