       (84, 1, 10, N'coordinates <511, 1988> check carefully, ', 34),
       (84, 1, 11, N'they are mixed with other One Armed Traitors.', 1),
       (84, 7, 0, N'Aha, after interrogation, the One Armed Spy', 1),
       (84, 7, 1, N'told me something about Ehlec Teroh. It is ', 1),
       (84, 7, 2, N'important information! Haha, I always wanted to ', 27),
       (84, 7, 3, N'know why he spared our Master... who would have ', 27),
       (84, 7, 4, N'thought. MauLi... It''s getting interesting, let''s', 1),
       (84, 7, 5, N'wait and see... Take this Purple Jade, it''s used ', 1),
       (84, 7, 6, N'for upgrading equipment. Use it wisely!', 1),
       (84, 9, 0, N'Check the One Armed Spy for me,', 1),
       (84, 9, 1, N'I believe they must related to the last incident.', 1),
       (84, 9, 2, N'Uh, you''re my best apprentice, I trust you!', 1),
       (85, 0, 0, N'After One Armed Traitors, it''s the Frozen Maidens''', 1),
       (85, 0, 1, N'turn to attack Ziming Plains. Haha, don''t tell me', 1),
       (85, 0, 2, N'you are shocked by the name? You have to', 1),
       (85, 0, 3, N'be careful, they are not easy to deal with,', 1),
       (85, 0, 4, N'50, no more, no less, don''t get yourself killed!', 1),
