       (85, 7, 0, N'Great. You''re are worthy of being', 1),
       (85, 7, 1, N'Elder Chong''s apprentice. You did a great job.', 1),
       (85, 7, 2, N'By the way, maybe you are not aware of this,', 1),
       (85, 7, 3, N'but a few days ago, General Long took revenge ', 27),
       (85, 7, 4, N'for Elder Chong. He challenged Ehlec Teroh alone,', 27),
       (85, 7, 5, N'and we still have not heard anything from him. ', 27),
       (85, 7, 6, N'I''m worried. He is the second best master in the', 1),
       (85, 7, 7, N'Guanyin. Do you think he is ok?', 1),
