       (86, 2, 7, N'Haha, its time to show my painting skill.', 1),
       (86, 2, 8, N'What?Paint a portrait for you?', 1),
       (86, 2, 9, N'Haha, no problem, I will do it once I go', 1),
       (86, 2, 10, N'back to the city.', 1),
       (86, 7, 0, N'Thank you for the Report. I''m sorry to have', 1),
       (86, 7, 1, N'troubled you. General Long? Erm, Oh yes.', 27),
       (86, 7, 2, N'he was defeated. He is really...haha...', 27),
       (86, 7, 3, N'Maybe this will teach him a lesson.', 1),
       (86, 9, 0, N'Young man, get Nhuzei''s Report for me,', 1),
       (86, 9, 1, N'yes, that Nhuzei of Kipaku Fortress.', 1),
       (86, 9, 2, N'Thats an important report.', 1),
       (87, 0, 0, N'Recently, our masters have been defeated one ', 1),
       (87, 0, 1, N'after another, that''s not good. It''s such a', 1),
       (87, 0, 2, N'chaotic situation. We are lucky to have you ', 1),
       (87, 0, 3, N'here, I''m not so worried now.', 1),
       (87, 0, 4, N'Your mission is to kill the Traveling Sanctuary ', 27),
       (87, 0, 5, N'of Ziming Plains or Kipaku Fortress.', 27),
       (87, 0, 6, N'You get it?', 27),
       (87, 0, 7, N'You can start off now.', 2),
       (87, 0, 8, N'Ziming Plains or Kipaku Fortress,', 1),
       (87, 0, 9, N'If you want to, you may go with your friend.', 1),
       (87, 1, 0, N'Kill the Traveling Sanctuary at Ziming Plains or', 2),
       (87, 1, 1, N'Kipaku Fortress. You should go with a friend.', 1),
       (87, 1, 2, N'I have to take care of those', 1),
       (87, 1, 3, N'betrayers, so I''m really tied up.', 1),
       (87, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (87, 1, 6, N'The Traveling Sanctuary is unique, its ', 34),
       (87, 1, 7, N'anti-social. The crabs can be found in', 34),
       (87, 1, 8, N'Ziming Plains to the South.', 34),
       (87, 1, 9, N'Be careful, it has powerful damage.', 1),
       (87, 1, 10, N'You may abandon the mission if you wish to.', 1),
       (87, 7, 0, N'Haha... well done. You''re the only hope for our', 1),
       (87, 7, 1, N'Guanyin.', 27),
       (87, 7, 2, N'Don''t feel conceited.', 1),
       (87, 7, 3, N'You''re still in the process of growing up, ', 27),
       (87, 7, 4, N'so work harder!', 27),
       (87, 8, 0, N'That''s it,', 1),
       (87, 8, 1, N'You go back and have a rest.', 1),
       (87, 9, 0, N'Kill The Traveling Sanctuary in Ziming Plains', 1),
       (87, 9, 1, N'or Kipaku Fortress. You should go with a', 1),
       (87, 9, 2, N'friend. I have to take care of those betrayers,', 1),
       (87, 9, 3, N'so I am really tied up.', 1),
       (88, 0, 0, N'Elder Chong told us to be aware of our Guardian''s', 27),
       (88, 0, 1, N'daughter, MauLi, she may be in danger.', 27),
       (88, 0, 2, N'Please go to the surrounding area, and inform ', 1),
       (88, 0, 3, N'the Messengers. Tell them to keep a close watch ', 27),
       (88, 0, 4, N'on MauLi and the Jinong.', 27),
       (88, 0, 5, N'And tell them to write regular Reports.', 1),
