       (88, 0, 7, N'Messenger Siano. He is in the Abiano Tomb,', 2),
       (88, 0, 8, N'its another cave connected to Kipaku Fortress.', 1),
       (88, 1, 0, N'Just transmit Elder Chong''s order to ', 1),
       (88, 1, 1, N'Messenger Siano. He is in the Abiano Tomb, its ', 1),
       (88, 1, 2, N'another cave connected to the Kipaku Fortress.', 2),
       (88, 1, 3, N'Let them keep a close watch on MauLi and the', 1),
       (88, 1, 4, N'Jinong.', 1),
       (88, 1, 5, N'Tell them to write regular Reports.', 1),
       (88, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 1),
       (88, 1, 7, N'Abiano Tomb is a cave connected to the', 30),
       (88, 1, 8, N'Kipaku Fortress. [Ziming Plains -> ', 34),
       (88, 1, 9, N'Kipaku Fortress -> Abiano Tomb]', 34),
       (88, 1, 10, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (88, 1, 11, N'Kipaku Fortress - Ziming Plains', 34),
       (88, 1, 12, N'coords <5530, 9252>, Abiano Tomb -', 34),
       (88, 1, 13, N'Kipaku Fortress coords <5304, 7008>,', 34),
       (88, 1, 14, N'Messenger Siano - Abiano Tomb <4562, 4918>', 34),
       (88, 7, 0, N'Ree?Who is that?Are you Elder Chong''s', 1),
       (88, 7, 1, N'apprentice? I''m Messenger Siano, what is it?', 1),
       (88, 7, 2, N'Huh? Really? Lupai ordered that? Fight against', 1),
       (88, 7, 3, N'those who seek to harm MauLi and make sure to ', 1),
       (88, 7, 4, N'watch out for the Jinong?', 1),
       (88, 7, 5, N'Ok, I got it, I will keep an eye on it.', 27),
       (88, 7, 11, N'** Special Notes **', 30),
       (88, 7, 12, N'After the mission has been accomplished,', 34),
       (88, 7, 13, N'you may accept Messenger Siano''s related mission.', 34),
