       (89, 1, 8, N'are to the South <3194, 5619>.', 34),
       (89, 1, 9, N'You will find them..', 34),
       (89, 1, 10, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (89, 1, 11, N'Abiano Tomb route coordinates - ', 34),
       (89, 1, 12, N'Kipaku Fortress <5304, 7008>', 34),
       (89, 1, 13, N'Messenger Siano coordinates - ', 1),
       (89, 1, 14, N'Abiano Tomb <4562, 4918>', 1),
       (89, 7, 0, N'Wow! Really great!', 1),
       (89, 7, 1, N'Thanks to you, the problem is solved... Why are', 1),
       (89, 7, 2, N'Blind Swordmaidens suddenly making trouble...', 1),
       (89, 7, 3, N'Luckily I had you, or I would be dead. Take it,', 1),
       (89, 7, 4, N'this little gift is a token of my gratitude,', 1),
       (89, 7, 5, N'I hope you like it.', 1),
       (89, 9, 0, N'Its me! Siano! Kill Blind Swordmaidens that ', 1),
       (89, 9, 1, N'reside in the Abiano Tomb!', 1),
       (89, 9, 2, N'Dang, why did they suddenly go mad?', 1),
       (90, 0, 0, N'As you know, General Long has been defeated by', 1),
       (90, 0, 1, N'Ehlec Teroh. Its a heavy blow to him. I want to', 27),
       (90, 0, 2, N'make a sword for him to cheer him up. The problem', 27),
       (90, 0, 3, N'is I am short on materials, the Red Gem is', 1),
       (90, 0, 4, N'critical in making this sword. From my knowledge,', 1),
       (90, 0, 5, N'Blind Swordmaidens of Ziming Plains have it.', 1),
       (90, 0, 6, N'They often appear to the South,', 1),
       (90, 0, 7, N'look for them in Ziming Plains.', 1),
       (90, 0, 8, N'Find the Red Gem and bring it to me.', 1),
       (90, 1, 0, N'They often appear in Ziming Plains, to the', 2),
       (90, 1, 1, N'South. Search all of Ziming Plains.', 2),
       (90, 1, 2, N'Find the Red Gem and bring it to me.', 1),
       (90, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (90, 1, 7, N'''Blind Swordmaiden'' are in Ziming Plains to the', 34),
