       (90, 1, 9, N'You will find it. ''Red Gem'' is a mission item,', 34),
       (90, 1, 10, N'catch Blind Swordmaiden.', 34),
       (90, 1, 11, N'It will appear, remember to bring it back.', 1),
       (90, 1, 12, N'You may abandon the mission if you wish to.', 1),
       (90, 7, 0, N'Good! Very good! Finally you''ve come!', 1),
       (90, 7, 1, N'Sorry to trouble you, I''m going to make the ', 1),
       (90, 7, 2, N'sword. This Dark Steel is for you.', 1),
       (90, 7, 3, N'It''s not very precious, but you will need it.', 1),
       (90, 8, 0, N'Wow...you really give up?', 1),
       (90, 8, 1, N'How could this happen? I said you can give up, ', 1),
       (90, 8, 2, N'but do you really want to? Oh! That''s it,', 1),
       (90, 8, 3, N'I need to find someone with a backbone!', 1),
       (90, 9, 0, N'Blind Swordmaiden are usually in Ziming Plains', 1),
       (90, 9, 1, N'South. Search all of Ziming Plains,', 1),
       (90, 9, 2, N'Find the Red Gem and bring it to me.', 1),
       (91, 0, 0, N'Haha, how do you do? Our Guardian wants to see', 1),
