       (92, 1, 11, N'Unholy Escort. Those foes will not give', 34),
       (92, 1, 12, N'Experience and items. Only attack these', 1),
       (92, 1, 13, N'enemies when you have a mission to do so.', 1),
       (92, 7, 0, N'I''m sorry to trouble you while you''re on a ', 1),
       (92, 7, 1, N'mission but I have checked the Nangin''s forces ', 1),
       (92, 7, 2, N'very carefully. You cannot imagine how powerful', 1),
       (92, 7, 3, N'they are. Far more powerful than we expected.', 27),
       (92, 7, 4, N'Not only high Masters from our Faction have left', 27),
       (92, 7, 5, N'in an attempt to be accepted as their disciples,', 27),
       (92, 7, 6, N'but even those from the Fujin and', 27),
       (92, 7, 7, N'the Jinong have also left and are', 1),
       (92, 7, 8, N'waiting to be accepted.What will become of our', 1),
       (92, 7, 9, N'world? What a mess!', 1),
       (92, 9, 0, N'Come here.', 1),
