       (93, 0, 3, N'Guard Captain Kyoku. This is a battle of ', 27),
       (93, 0, 4, N'annihilation, kill those people who are against', 1),
       (93, 0, 5, N'us. If we don''t go, other Factions will do it.', 27),
       (93, 0, 6, N'There is no room for failure this time.', 27),
       (93, 0, 7, N'You may give up if you don''t want to go.', 27),
       (93, 0, 8, N'This battle ground is only for levels 70-79.', 1),
       (93, 1, 0, N'When its time, go to Lema Tsou Grounds', 1),
       (93, 1, 1, N'through Guard Captain Kyoku. This battle ground', 2),
       (93, 1, 2, N'is only for levels 70-79, so be careful.', 1),
       (93, 1, 3, N'You may give up if you don''t want to go.', 30),
       (93, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (93, 1, 7, N'Lema Tsou Grounds. Levels 70-79 only.', 34),
       (93, 1, 8, N'A combat hotspot (takes place each hour).', 34),
       (93, 1, 9, N'You can participate by speaking to', 1),
       (93, 1, 10, N'Guard Captian Kyoku or via the prompt window. We', 1),
