       (143, 1, 2, N'Master Rei. Tell Kianli to be more alert, and if ', 1),
       (143, 1, 3, N'anything happens, to report to Gate Master Rei.', 1),
       (143, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (143, 1, 6, N'Kaitsu Cavern is a cave in Chikurin Ravine East', 34),
       (143, 1, 7, N'at coordinates <3779, 7009>.', 34),
       (143, 1, 8, N'Kianli is in Kaitsu Cavern central - ', 1),
       (143, 1, 9, N'waiting in coordinates <3736, 5303>.', 1),
       (143, 1, 10, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (143, 7, 0, N'Wow! Its been a long time. I never see our', 1),
       (143, 7, 1, N'disciples anymore! I''m really bored, this stinks!', 1),
       (143, 7, 2, N'I know I need to keep alert, but I just can''t', 1),
       (143, 7, 3, N'handle it anymore. Oh, dont worry, I will be', 1),
       (143, 7, 4, N'ready anyway, thanks.', 1),
       (143, 9, 0, N'Come over here!', 1),
       (143, 9, 1, N'Please tell Kianli to be alert,', 1),
       (143, 9, 2, N'and to report if anything happens!', 1),
       (144, 0, 0, N'I''m sorry, you have to go to Kaitsu Cavern again.', 1),
       (144, 0, 1, N'We just got the message, Reanimated Master are ', 1),
       (144, 0, 2, N'attacking people. Kianli can''t hold on, please ', 1),
       (144, 0, 3, N'you must go and kill them. About 80 will do the ', 27),
       (144, 0, 4, N'job. Report to me after the mission is over.', 27),
       (144, 1, 0, N'Kill Reanimated Master of Kaitsu Cavern for me,', 1),
       (144, 1, 1, N'about 80 will do the job.', 1),
       (144, 1, 2, N'Report to me after the mission is over.', 2),
       (144, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (144, 1, 5, N'This mission is to Kill Kaitsu Cavern''s ', 34),
       (144, 1, 6, N'Reanimated Masters.', 34),
       (144, 1, 7, N'Reanimated Master is in Kaitsu Cavern central -', 34),
       (144, 1, 8, N'coordinates <3238, 5838>. You will find them..', 34),
       (144, 1, 9, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (144, 1, 10, N'Kaitsu Cavern route coordinates - ', 34),
       (144, 1, 11, N'Chikurin Ravine<3779, 7009>', 1),
       (144, 7, 0, N'Well, mission accomplished. I''m sorry to', 1),
       (144, 7, 1, N'trouble you, I know you have been busy.', 1),
       (144, 7, 2, N'It''s just that we only have limited disciples,', 1),
       (144, 7, 3, N'so it feels more nerve-racking than ever...', 1),
       (144, 7, 4, N'I have to work harder to improve myself...', 1),
       (144, 9, 0, N'You are the only choice for this mission.', 1),
       (144, 9, 1, N'Kill the Reanimated Master of Kaitsu Cavern.', 1),
       (144, 9, 2, N'There is no second choice in my mind...', 1),
       (145, 0, 0, N'You''re ready for Chal Fi Grounds.', 1),
       (145, 0, 1, N'From now on, the Nangin may be involved', 1),
       (145, 0, 2, N'in every battle, making it more risky, and the', 1),
       (145, 0, 3, N'occupying method different. Prepare yourself,', 1),
       (145, 0, 4, N'and watch out for other enemies. When its time,', 1),
       (145, 0, 5, N'go to Chal Fi Grounds. Let us fight for', 1),
       (145, 0, 6, N'honor and glory!', 1),
       (145, 1, 0, N'When its time, go to Chal Fi Grounds.', 1),
       (145, 1, 1, N'Be careful, its dangerous.', 1),
       (145, 1, 2, N'You may give up if you''re too worried.', 2),
       (145, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (145, 1, 7, N'Chal Fi Grounds. Level 106-112 only.', 34),
       (145, 1, 8, N'A combat hotspot (takes place each hour).', 34),
       (145, 1, 9, N'You can enter by speaking to Guard Captian Kyoku', 34),
       (145, 1, 10, N'or via the prompt window. You must hold the', 34),
       (145, 1, 11, N'position for 5 minutes to win. Remember, there', 34),
       (145, 1, 12, N'will be Area Attack foes, making this battle', 34),
       (145, 1, 13, N'uncertain. Always bear this in mind.', 1),
       (145, 7, 0, N'Here, this is Steel of Eternity, take it.', 1),
       (145, 7, 1, N'You''re getting better, I really admire you. Who', 1),
       (145, 7, 2, N'knows, maybe someday you will be the strongest?', 1),
       (145, 7, 3, N'Work harder! Hahaha Hahaha!', 1),
       (145, 8, 0, N'That''s it, go back to have some rest.', 1),
       (145, 8, 1, N'I will get someone else.', 1),
       (145, 9, 0, N'Just fight like before,', 1),
       (145, 9, 1, N'but be aware of hidden enemies. By the way,', 1),
       (145, 9, 2, N'other Factions will trouble you as well...', 1),
       (146, 0, 0, N'Please do me a favor. Did you know that', 1),
