       (149, 7, 1, N'I have to make a report.', 1),
       (149, 7, 2, N'This Fortune Pouch is for you.', 1),
       (149, 9, 0, N'Please come over here,', 1),
       (149, 9, 1, N'Those Kitfo Warriors appear in Chikurin Ravine ', 1),
       (149, 9, 2, N'East. They are such disturbing creatures.', 1),
       (150, 0, 0, N'It looks like the Mythical Gatekeepers are still', 1),
       (150, 0, 1, N'resisting. Now they have the Holy Sirens', 1),
       (150, 0, 2, N'aiding them. I hope you are up for the challenge.', 1),
       (150, 0, 3, N'Go and give them an unforgettable experience!', 1),
       (150, 0, 4, N'Holy Sirens appear in the Chikurin Ravine.', 1),
       (150, 0, 5, N'Just kill 1, and Chikurin Ravine will return to', 2),
       (150, 0, 6, N'peace. Don''t be confused by their beauty!', 1),
       (150, 1, 0, N'Holy Sirens appears in the Chikurin Ravine,', 1),
       (150, 1, 1, N'Just kill 1, and Chikurin Ravine will return to', 2),
       (150, 1, 2, N'peace. Don''t be confused by their beauty!', 1),
       (150, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (150, 1, 7, N'Holy Sirens are unique and anti-social.', 34),
       (150, 1, 8, N'They''re located in the Chikurin Ravine to the', 34),
       (150, 1, 9, N'South. Be careful, they''re quite strong!', 34),
       (150, 1, 10, N'You may abandon the mission if you wish to.', 1),
       (150, 7, 0, N'Haha, good, not distracted by beauty. You are', 1),
       (150, 7, 1, N'a real hero! Very well done!', 1),
       (150, 7, 2, N'This is Steel of Eternity. Take it,', 1),
       (150, 7, 3, N'I will have more business for you in the future.', 1),
       (150, 9, 0, N'Come! The Holy Sirens', 1),
       (150, 9, 1, N'have appeared in Chikurin Ravine. They are', 1),
       (150, 9, 2, N'stunningly beautiful, so don''t get confused!', 1),
       (151, 0, 0, N'Just like last time, go to Saigo Temple. There ', 1),
       (151, 0, 1, N'are still not enough materials in the Medical', 1),
       (151, 0, 2, N'Chest, and I need ''Medicated Wine'' from', 1),
       (151, 0, 3, N'Herbalist Huang. This is the treasure of', 1),
       (151, 0, 4, N'Herbalist Huang, and its necessary for making', 2),
       (151, 0, 5, N'an antitoxic elixer. Please help me out!', 2),
       (151, 1, 0, N'Thank you for getting back the Medical Chest,', 1),
       (151, 1, 1, N'but there is not enough materials in it. If you', 1),
       (151, 1, 2, N'can get ''Medicated Wine'' from Herbalist Huang,', 1),
       (151, 1, 3, N'I will produce an effective antitoxic elixer.', 1),
       (151, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
