       (151, 1, 8, N'Saigo Temple, but you have to pay.', 34),
       (151, 1, 9, N'Herbalist Huang is at coordinates <3896, 5194>.', 1),
       (151, 2, 0, N'Why are you always disturbing me while I''m', 1),
       (151, 2, 1, N'drinking... dang... What? Medicated Wine!', 1),
       (151, 2, 2, N'Thats my precious...!!! Uh? To save lives?', 1),
       (151, 2, 3, N'......', 1),
       (151, 2, 4, N'All right, take it...', 1),
       (151, 7, 0, N'Got it? Great! Haha, but now who am I suppose', 1),
       (151, 7, 1, N'to thank? Herbalist Huang or you? I''m really', 1),
       (151, 7, 2, N'grateful... I will develop it right now, ', 1),
       (151, 7, 3, N'I won''t let you down!', 1),
       (151, 9, 0, N'Come here. Get some Medicated Wine', 1),
       (151, 9, 1, N'from Herbalist Huang for me.', 1),
       (151, 9, 2, N'I need it!', 1),
       (152, 0, 0, N'Sacred Blood Lords have come again! They are all ', 1),
       (152, 0, 1, N'Chikurin Ravine and Kaitsu Cavern.', 1),
       (152, 0, 2, N'Just go finish them all, dang.', 1),
       (152, 0, 3, N'Oh, and be aware of their attacking range.', 1),
       (152, 1, 0, N'Sacred Blood Lords are all over Chikurin Ravine ', 2),
       (152, 1, 1, N'and Kaitsu Cavern. Just finish them all, dang.', 1),
       (152, 1, 2, N'Oh, and be aware of their attacking range.', 1),
       (152, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
