       (153, 0, 4, N'Broadsword foes still in the Kaitsu Cavern and ', 2),
       (153, 0, 5, N'Chikurin Ravine, but that one of the Ghosts of ', 1),
       (153, 0, 6, N'Azreal, that was in Ro''s report, has been changed', 1),
       (153, 0, 7, N'by the Nangin and mutated into a Dual Hookblade.', 1),
       (153, 0, 8, N'It happened to the Broadsword Mercenary as well.', 1),
       (153, 0, 9, N'So,s you are the only choice we have to handle', 1),
       (153, 0, 10, N'this matter. This creature is stronger than ', 27),
       (153, 0, 11, N'Ghost of Azreal, so be careful.', 27),
       (153, 1, 0, N'Messenger Kianli''s report shows, that just like ', 1),
       (153, 1, 1, N'the Broadsword foes, the Dual Hookblades are in ', 1),
       (153, 1, 2, N'the Kaitsu Cavern and Chikurin Ravine.', 1),
       (153, 1, 3, N'These creatures are stronger than ', 1),
       (153, 1, 4, N'Ghost of Azreal. Please be careful.', 1),
       (153, 1, 6, N'** Reference material **', 30),
       (153, 1, 7, N'Dual Hookblade appears in Kaitsu Caverns', 34),
       (153, 1, 8, N'to the South East at corrdinate <5771, 6305>.', 34),
       (153, 7, 0, N'Keep up the great work!', 1),
       (153, 7, 1, N'You must be proud of your abilities.', 1),
       (153, 7, 2, N'Me? I''m still trying to catch up with you.', 1),
       (153, 7, 3, N'Hahaha! You must be feeling good today.', 1),
       (153, 7, 4, N'Go and have a rest!', 1),
       (153, 9, 0, N'Please come. Gargantuan Guardians and the', 1),
       (153, 9, 1, N'Ghosts of Azreal have acquired powerful', 1),
       (153, 9, 2, N'abilities. They''re in the Kaitsu Cavern. These', 1),
       (153, 9, 3, N'beasts are stronger than normal Ghosts of Azreal.', 1),
       (154, 0, 0, N'Such a pity, no progress has been made in', 1),
       (154, 0, 1, N'making the antitoxic potion. It seems we need a', 1),
       (154, 0, 2, N'new ingredient. Please get ''Violet Pill'' from', 1),
       (154, 0, 3, N'Beggar Shu of Saigo Temple; they''re', 1),
       (154, 0, 4, N'good for making antitoxic. Thank you, now hurry!', 2),
