       (156, 1, 3, N'Fujin, Jinong, and Nangin are involved', 1),
       (156, 1, 4, N'so you better take it seriously.', 1),
       (156, 1, 5, N'You will benefit a lot if we win.', 30),
       (156, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (156, 1, 7, N'Occupy Yang Formation and hold it for 5 ', 34),
       (156, 1, 8, N'minutes. If we win, our Faction will get 10% EXP', 34),
       (156, 1, 9, N'bonus for 3 hours. If we are the last standing,', 34),
       (156, 1, 10, N'we will be considered the winners.', 34),
       (156, 1, 11, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (156, 1, 12, N'Yanggok Valley, Ziming Plains <1532, 9446>', 34),
       (156, 1, 13, N'Yanggok Valley, Rojiko Caverns <8768, 1679>', 34),
       (156, 7, 0, N'Haha,we won? Great!', 1),
       (156, 7, 1, N'I always believed in you!', 1),
       (156, 8, 0, N'Lost? Its ok, we will make it the next time.', 1),
       (156, 8, 1, N'Just don''t lose your faith.', 1),
       (156, 9, 0, N'Come to me please.', 1),
       (156, 9, 1, N'It''s time to join the battle of Yanggok Valley.', 1),
       (156, 9, 2, N'Take it seriously.', 1),
       (156, 9, 3, N'You will benefit a lot if we win.', 1),
       (157, 0, 0, N'You''re ready for the Chal Fi Grounds', 1),
       (157, 0, 1, N'battle...  From now on, the Nangin may be ', 1),
       (157, 0, 2, N'involved in every battle.  This will make it more', 1),
       (157, 0, 3, N'risky, and the occupying method will have to ', 1),
       (157, 0, 4, N'change. Ok, prepare yourself, and watch out', 1),
       (157, 0, 5, N'for other enemies! When its time, talk to Kyoku ', 1),
       (157, 0, 6, N'to go to Chal Fi Grounds. Let us fight ', 27),
       (157, 0, 7, N'together for honor and glory!', 27),
       (157, 1, 0, N'When its time, go to Chal Fi Grounds', 1),
       (157, 1, 1, N'by talking to Kyoku. Be careful, it''s getting ', 1),
       (157, 1, 2, N'dangerous there.  You may give up if you''re ', 1),
       (157, 1, 3, N'too scared.', 1),
       (157, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (157, 1, 7, N'Chal Fi Grounds only level 106-112', 34),
       (157, 1, 8, N'citizens are allowed. A combat hotspot (hourly', 34),
       (157, 1, 9, N'battles) When the time comes, you may enter by ', 34),
       (157, 1, 10, N'Guard Captain Kyoku or the prompt window. Hold ', 34),
       (157, 1, 11, N'the position for 5 minutes to win. ', 34),
       (157, 1, 12, N'There will be foes who can perform Area Attack.', 34),
       (157, 1, 13, N'This will make the battle unpredictable.', 34),
       (157, 1, 14, N'Always bear this in mind.', 1),
       (157, 7, 0, N'Because of you, the Guanyin has', 27),
       (157, 7, 1, N'regained it''s glory! One day, your fame will', 1),
       (157, 7, 2, N'surpass even our Guardian''s! ', 1),
       (157, 7, 3, N'Keep up the hard work!', 1),
       (157, 8, 0, N'That''s it, go back and get some rest.', 1),
       (157, 8, 1, N'I can count on others.', 1),
       (157, 9, 0, N'Just fight like you did before, but', 1),
       (157, 9, 1, N'be aware of hiden enemies. By the way, ', 1),
       (157, 9, 2, N'other Factions will fight furiously...', 1),
       (158, 0, 0, N'Long time no see. You look even more fierce!', 1),
       (158, 0, 1, N'Seems you''re the best choice for this mission!', 1),
       (158, 0, 2, N'There are some reckless guys in Chikurin Ravine.', 1),
       (158, 0, 3, N'How about you go and finish 60 Serpent Knights?', 2),
       (158, 0, 4, N'Go pass the Kusimono Cave, and you will see', 1),
       (158, 0, 5, N'Chikurin Ravine. They will be there, go and', 1),
       (158, 0, 6, N'finish them!', 1),
       (158, 1, 0, N'There are some reckless guys in Chikurin Ravine.', 1),
       (158, 1, 1, N'How about you go and finish 60 Serpent Knights. ', 1),
       (158, 1, 2, N'Go past the Kusimono Cave, and you will see', 1),
       (158, 1, 3, N'Chikurin Ravine. They will be there, go and', 2),
       (158, 1, 4, N'finish them!', 2),
       (158, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (158, 1, 7, N'''Serpent Knights'' are in Chikurin Ravine area', 34),
       (158, 1, 8, N'to the East - around coordinates <6525, 8049>.', 34),
       (158, 1, 9, N'You will find them..', 34),
       (158, 7, 0, N'What? You''re kidding right? You''re already', 1),
       (158, 7, 1, N' finished? That fast? Wow, I thought we would', 27),
       (158, 7, 2, N'have to wait until tomorrow... Well, hehe, the ', 27),
       (158, 7, 3, N'Nangin should be quiet for some time. Thank you', 1),
       (158, 7, 4, N'for what you did today!', 1),
       (158, 9, 0, N'Hey it''s been a long time. I''m Kyoku, remember ', 1),
       (158, 9, 1, N'me? Haha, I have mission for you again.', 1),
       (159, 0, 0, N'Haha, it''s been along time. Do you remember your', 1),
       (159, 0, 1, N'little sister? I''m Aikosa.', 1),
       (159, 0, 2, N'I''m sorry, I lost some something again, haha.', 1),
       (159, 0, 3, N'It''s a weapon called Soul Capture Reaphook, ', 1),
       (159, 0, 4, N'and it means alot to me. Now it''s ', 1),
       (159, 0, 5, N'in the hands of Serpent Knights of Kaitsu Cavern.', 1),
       (159, 0, 6, N'If you beat Serpent Knights, you will get it!', 1),
       (159, 1, 0, N'Soul Capture Reaphook is in the hand of ', 1),
       (159, 1, 1, N'Serpent Knights of Kaitsu Cavern. Beat ', 1),
       (159, 1, 2, N'Serpent Knights and you will get it. ', 2),
       (159, 1, 3, N'Thank you, I know it''s difficult.', 1),
       (159, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (159, 1, 7, N'''Serpent Knights'' is in Kaitsu Cavern to the ', 34),
       (159, 1, 8, N'North - around <4672, 3736>. You will find it..', 34),
       (159, 1, 9, N'''Soul Capture Reaphook'' is a mission item. ', 34),
       (159, 1, 10, N'Catch Serpent Knights to find it. Bring it back.', 34),
       (159, 1, 11, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (159, 1, 12, N'Kaitsu Cavern - Chikurin Ravine <3779, 7009>', 34),
       (159, 7, 0, N'Haha, I never lost faith in you.', 1),
       (159, 7, 1, N'Thank you so much.', 1),
       (159, 7, 2, N'I hope you will help me again sometime.', 1),
       (159, 8, 0, N'Even you think its too difficult?', 1),
       (159, 8, 1, N'Ugh...so disappointed...', 1),
       (159, 9, 0, N'Hi, can you help me?', 1),
       (159, 9, 1, N'Beat Kaitsu Cavern''s Serpent Knights.', 1),
       (159, 9, 2, N'They took my item, and it means a lot to me.', 1),
       (159, 9, 3, N'Please, you have to help me.', 1),
       (160, 0, 0, N'What are the Nangin thinking? It seems Ehlec ', 1),
       (160, 0, 1, N'Teroh wants to see you. Are you getting too ', 1),
       (160, 0, 2, N'famous? Aha...but you have to respect his power.', 1),
       (160, 0, 3, N'That would be awesome if we could have him ', 1),
       (160, 0, 4, N'on our side, haha. I know its dangerous, but you', 1),
       (160, 0, 5, N'have to face him. Find out what is he thinking.', 27),
       (160, 0, 6, N'He is waiting near the Kagirina River.', 1),
       (160, 0, 7, N'If you''re thinking you can take him.. Ha!', 1),
       (160, 0, 8, N'That''s almost impossible!', 1),
       (160, 1, 0, N'He is waiting near the Kagirina River.', 1),
       (160, 1, 1, N'I know its dangerous, but you have to face him.', 1),
       (160, 1, 2, N'Find out what is he thinking. If you''re thinking', 1),
       (160, 1, 3, N'you can take him.. Ha! Thats almost impossible!', 1),
       (160, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (160, 1, 5, N'Mission target ''Guardian Ehlec Teroh'' is near ', 34),
       (160, 1, 6, N'the Kagirina River entrance <8723, 13457>.', 34),
       (160, 1, 7, N'He has a mighty defense and a powerful', 34),
       (160, 1, 8, N'area attack. Please bear this in mind.', 34),
       (160, 7, 0, N'Haha, I didn''t expect much. After all, he is the', 1),
       (160, 7, 1, N'most powerful warrior of all the major Factions.', 27),
       (160, 7, 2, N'As long as he is not on the other two sides we''ll', 27),
       (160, 7, 3, N'be ok, I think. Hahaha! I have to speak to', 1),
       (160, 7, 4, N'our Guardian. You get yourself healed.', 1),
       (160, 9, 0, N'Come over here. Nangin''s Guardian, Ehlec Teroh, ', 1),
       (160, 9, 1, N'is waiting somewhere in Kagirina River.', 1),
       (160, 9, 2, N'I don''t know what he wanted, but I', 1),
       (160, 9, 3, N'believe he is going to try you out. Try your best', 1),
       (160, 9, 4, N'and get as much information as possible.', 1),
       (161, 0, 0, N'Hi, I''m Trader Xhai, we meet for the first time.', 1),
       (161, 0, 1, N'Recently, on my way to Ling Chi Fortress,', 1),
       (161, 0, 2, N'I met a monster called the White Ape Alpha Male.', 27),
       (161, 0, 3, N'He is very powerful, and I''m just a girl. ', 27),
       (161, 0, 4, N'All I can do is to run away... ', 1),
       (161, 0, 5, N'I will be heading oustide of Ling Chi Fortress ', 1),
       (161, 0, 6, N'again and I''m very worried...Can you kill it ', 2),
       (161, 0, 7, N'for me? He hides in the Ling Chi Fortress area,', 2),
       (161, 0, 8, N'as a dead white monkey. Thank you!', 27),
       (161, 1, 0, N'White Ape Alpha Male is hiding somwhere around ', 2),
       (161, 1, 1, N'Ling Chi Fortress. You have to search carefully,', 2),
       (161, 1, 2, N'he is disguised as a dead white monkey.', 1),
       (161, 1, 3, N'You can tell when you see him.', 1),
       (161, 1, 4, N'Just do your sister a favor...', 1),
       (161, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (161, 1, 7, N'Mission Target ''White Ape Alpha Male'' is around ', 34),
       (161, 1, 8, N'Ling Chi Fortress to the South East, ', 34),
       (161, 1, 9, N'coordinates <12200, 13429>.', 1),
       (161, 7, 0, N'Wow! You solved the White Ape Alpha Male problem!', 1),
       (161, 7, 1, N'Thank you, so much!', 1),
       (161, 9, 0, N'Help me! ', 1),
       (161, 9, 1, N'White Ape Alpha Male is hiding in ', 1),
       (161, 9, 2, N'Ling Chi Fortress. I''m in trouble.', 1),
       (161, 9, 3, N'Can you kill the White Ape Alpha Male for me?', 1),
       (162, 0, 0, N'Dangit! These darn challenges of the Nangin!!', 1),
       (162, 0, 1, N'They come at the worst time!', 1),
       (162, 0, 2, N'That last incident could very well lead to...', 27),
       (162, 0, 3, N'The Guardian and Elder Deison are wounded ', 27),
       (162, 0, 4, N'seriously! This is panacea, it took a lot of work', 1),
       (162, 0, 5, N'to make it!Please deliver it to Elder Deison, or ', 1),
       (162, 0, 6, N'we will be in trouble! Elder Deison is in ', 2),
       (162, 0, 7, N'Ling Chi Fortress South''s Palace.', 1),
       (162, 1, 0, N'Go there quickly! I Hope this potion ', 1),
       (162, 1, 1, N'can save their lives... I hope the Guardian will ', 1),
       (162, 1, 2, N'be ok, he was wounded very seriously! ', 2),
       (162, 1, 3, N'Elder Deison is in Ling Chi Fortress to the ', 1),
       (162, 1, 4, N'South by the Palace.', 30),
       (162, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes ** ', 34),
       (162, 1, 7, N'He is in Ling Chi Fortress South of general ', 1),
       (162, 1, 8, N'guardian building, waiting at coordinates ', 1),
       (162, 1, 9, N'<8293, 15872>. Please head towards ', 1),
       (162, 7, 0, N'Ah! Is the potion made by Herbalist Chang?', 1),
       (162, 7, 1, N'I hope it''s not too late...', 1),
       (162, 7, 2, N'Oh, my wounds have still not recovered yet.', 1),
       (162, 7, 3, N'Ok, I have to go back to the Genzong Hall.', 1),
       (162, 9, 0, N'Here is something urgent, please come!', 1),
       (162, 9, 1, N'The Guardian is seriously wounded, be quick!', 1),
       (162, 9, 2, N'Elder Deison is in Ling Chi Fortress South of ', 1),
       (162, 9, 3, N'General Guardian building.', 1),
       (162, 9, 4, N'I hope its not too late...', 1),
       (163, 0, 0, N'I heard about you, ', 1),
       (163, 0, 1, N'Glad to meet you,', 1),
       (163, 0, 2, N'Well, a few days ago, during a battle,', 27),
       (163, 0, 3, N'I was wounded by a Arachnid Hybrid''s ambush,', 27),
       (163, 0, 4, N'If the Guardian had not been there, I would have ', 27),
       (163, 0, 5, N'been killed. But the thing is, the Guardian has ', 1),
       (163, 0, 6, N'been seriously wounded. So Fohchoy', 1),
       (163, 0, 7, N'wants you to kill the Arachnid Hybrid ', 1),
       (163, 0, 8, N'to take revenge! As I know, the Arachnid Hybrid ', 1),
       (163, 0, 9, N'is hiding in Ling Chi Fortress''s West Gate ', 1),
       (163, 0, 10, N'bridge, around a big rock.', 1),
       (163, 1, 0, N'Arachnid Hybrid has wounded our Guardian.', 27),
       (163, 1, 1, N'Kill him quicky.', 1),
       (163, 1, 2, N'We cannot tolerate his evil doing anymore!', 1),
       (163, 1, 3, N'Arachnid Hybrid is hiding in Ling Chi Fortress''s', 2),
       (163, 1, 4, N'West Gate bridge, around a big rock.', 2),
       (163, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (163, 1, 7, N'Mission Target ''Arachnid Hybrid'' ', 34),
       (163, 1, 8, N'is around Ling Chi Fortress in the South West, ', 34),
       (163, 1, 9, N'coordinates <4732, 13090>.', 1),
       (163, 7, 0, N'I''m sorry to trouble you, I feel relieved...', 1),
       (163, 7, 1, N'Lightbringer is curing them now,', 1),
       (163, 7, 2, N'I am awaiting the news of your success!', 1),
       (163, 7, 3, N'Anyways, have you ever thought about giving ', 1),
       (163, 7, 4, N'your best for the Faction? Its ok, you don''t ', 27),
       (163, 7, 5, N'have to answer me right now. Think about it.', 27),
       (163, 9, 0, N'Come to me, we need to talk.', 1),
       (163, 9, 1, N'Arachnid Hybrid is hiding around the rock just ', 1),
       (163, 9, 2, N'past the West Gate bridge of Ling Chi Fortress.', 1),
       (163, 9, 3, N'He too was wounded, go there and finish him!', 1),
       (164, 0, 0, N'People now adays have no respect for weapons.', 1),
       (164, 0, 1, N'They damage weapons as if it won''t cost money...', 1),
       (164, 0, 2, N'Oh, sorry about that, I need your help again!', 1),
       (164, 0, 3, N'I need some weapon repairing material. ', 1),
       (164, 0, 4, N'The Holy Iron is missing.', 1),
       (164, 0, 5, N'I need you to go to Saigo Temple,', 1),
       (164, 0, 6, N'find my friend Lokai, and', 1),
       (164, 0, 7, N'get some Holy Iron. Thank you.', 1),
       (164, 0, 8, N'You may ask Miko to send you there.', 1),
       (164, 1, 0, N'I can''t repair weapons without Holy Iron.', 1),
       (164, 1, 1, N'Please find my friend, Lokai in Saigo Temple,', 2),
       (164, 1, 2, N'and get some Holy Iron. Thank you.', 1),
       (164, 1, 3, N'You may ask Miko to send you there.', 1),
       (164, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (164, 1, 7, N'Go to Gate Master Miko if you are heading to ', 34),
       (164, 1, 8, N'Saigo Temple. Gate Master Ling will help you ', 34),
       (164, 1, 9, N'if you need to come back. Blacksmith Lokai is in ', 34),
       (164, 1, 10, N'Saigo Temple, North West <3376, 5118>.', 1),
       (164, 1, 11, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (164, 2, 0, N'Well, you were sent by Blacksmith Kew.', 1),
       (164, 2, 1, N'Ok, this is Holy Iron, take it.', 1),
       (164, 2, 2, N'Don''t make him wait.', 1),
       (164, 7, 0, N'Sorry to trouble you!', 1),
       (164, 7, 1, N'I''m busy, we''re in dangerous times, that''s ', 1),
       (164, 7, 2, N'why I can''t relax. I will make it up ', 1),
       (164, 7, 3, N'to you next time.', 1),
       (164, 9, 0, N'Can you help me out this time?', 1),
       (164, 9, 1, N'I need some materials!', 1),
       (164, 9, 2, N'I need someone to go to Saigo Temple.', 1),
       (165, 0, 0, N'You already defeated them! Wow, now it''s the ', 1),
       (165, 0, 1, N'''Goblinkin Soldiers'' turn in Ling Chi Fortress.', 1),
       (165, 0, 2, N'They plan to attack our city while our Guardian ', 27),
       (165, 0, 3, N'and Deison are absent. You''re the only one I can ', 27),
       (165, 0, 4, N'count on, so please help. All the others have ', 1),
       (165, 0, 5, N'been sent to the frontline. ', 1),
       (165, 0, 6, N'Kill 40 Goblinkin Soldiers, they usually appear ', 1),
       (165, 0, 7, N'outside Ling Chi Fortress!', 2),
       (165, 0, 8, N'Do me a favor, for old times'' sake!', 1),
       (165, 1, 0, N'Goblinkin Soldiers are reckless and tough foes.', 1),
       (165, 1, 1, N'Although you only need 40 of them, it may easily ', 1),
       (165, 1, 2, N'turn into an enduring battle. You have to go for ', 1),
       (165, 1, 3, N'it to prove your capabilities in war! I will be ', 1);
