       (165, 9, 3, N'Mop them up completely, leave no survivors!', 1),
       (166, 0, 0, N'Bad news! Guanyin and Jinong', 1),
       (166, 0, 1, N' are coming again! Its really troublesome, ', 1),
       (166, 0, 2, N'they are also short handed, but... dear me, don''t', 1),
       (166, 0, 3, N'waste time, just go to Bui Di Grounds ', 1),
       (166, 0, 4, N'by me. Just kill Guanyin ', 1),
       (166, 0, 5, N'and Jinong! If we win, its not just ', 1),
       (166, 0, 6, N'our honor, its your honor as well! Don''t worry, ', 1),
       (166, 0, 7, N'only level 10-19 are allowed to fight, no risks.', 1),
       (166, 1, 0, N'You can enter Bui Di Grounds if you ', 1),
       (166, 1, 1, N'have time. Win the battle by finishing Guanyin', 1),
       (166, 1, 2, N'and Jinong! Don''t worry, ', 1),
       (166, 1, 3, N'only level 10-19 are allowed to fight.', 1),
       (166, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (166, 1, 6, N'Bui Di Grounds only citizens', 34),
       (166, 1, 7, N'with level 10~19 are allowed to enter.', 34),
       (166, 1, 8, N'A combat hotspot (takes place each hour ', 34),
       (166, 1, 9, N'each time) When the time', 34),
       (166, 1, 10, N'comes, go there by Guard Captain', 1),
       (166, 1, 11, N'Fashu or prompt windows. Win the ', 1),
       (166, 1, 12, N'battle by surviving until all ', 1),
       (166, 1, 13, N'enemies are killed. You may ', 1),
       (166, 1, 14, N'abandon the mission if you wish to.', 1),
       (166, 7, 0, N'Just like what I expected, you are really ', 1),
       (166, 7, 1, N'outstanding! In this chaotic situation, it''s ', 1),
       (166, 7, 2, N'you who makes me confident! ', 1),
       (166, 7, 3, N'Thank you, sorry to trouble you!', 1),
       (166, 8, 0, N'When will you not fail my expectations?', 1),
       (166, 8, 1, N'Dang...', 1),
       (166, 9, 0, N'Come to Ling Chi Fortress North Gate. We are ', 1),
       (166, 9, 1, N'short handed. A lot of experience will be ', 1),
       (166, 9, 2, N'rewarded if you win! ', 1),
       (167, 0, 0, N'I have seen this face before...', 1),
       (167, 0, 1, N'I remember, you''re that well known ''babysitter''!', 1),
       (167, 0, 2, N'Haha, sorry, I haven''t seen you since you left ', 1),
       (167, 0, 3, N'the Guard unit. Haha....ok, no more joking.', 1),
       (167, 0, 4, N'By the way, I need your help.', 1),
