       (167, 0, 6, N'were worshiping the God of water, but for ', 1),
       (167, 0, 7, N'some unholy reason, she has come under', 1),
       (167, 0, 8, N' some dark evil...now she opposes', 1),
       (167, 0, 9, N'all Factions on Earth! Therefore, you need to', 1),
       (167, 0, 10, N'teach her a little lesson. Go out', 1),
       (167, 0, 11, N'and kill the Disloyal Maiden. She''s hiding ', 1),
       (167, 0, 12, N'somewhere in the Ling Chi Fortress area, ', 2),
       (167, 0, 13, N'so please help.', 2),
       (167, 1, 0, N'She is hiding in the entire Ling Chi Fortress ', 2),
       (167, 1, 1, N'area. You need to search carefully to find her.', 1),
       (167, 1, 2, N'She is a maiden of the God of Water. Therefore,', 27),
       (167, 1, 3, N'she dresses differently. Please defeat her ', 27),
       (167, 1, 4, N'in battle. Thank you.', 1),
       (167, 1, 7, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (167, 1, 8, N'Disloyal Maiden is very unique, she is usually by', 34),
       (167, 1, 9, N'herself. She is located around Ling Chi Fortress ', 34),
       (167, 1, 10, N'to the North. She has plenty of Vitality, so be ', 34),
       (167, 1, 11, N'careful. You may abandon the mission ', 1),
       (167, 1, 12, N'if you wish to.', 1),
       (167, 7, 0, N' Youth is the best thing in the world. ', 1),
       (167, 7, 1, N'We''re too old.', 1),
       (167, 7, 2, N'A few days ago, the Guardian passed away...', 1),
       (167, 7, 3, N'That''s it, he saved Elder Deison despite being ', 1),
       (167, 7, 4, N'seriously wounded, how could this happen...', 27),
       (167, 7, 5, N'Oh, what will be our Faction''s future...', 1),
       (167, 7, 6, N'This tragic news isn''t to be announced yet,', 27),
       (167, 7, 7, N'be careful, don''t tell anyone!', 27),
       (167, 8, 0, N'I''ll take care of it.', 1),
       (167, 8, 1, N'Have a rest.', 1),
