       (215, 7, 3, N'near here. Uh, it seem this unrest will be long', 27),
       (215, 7, 4, N'lasting. I heard the Guanyin''s General Long ', 27),
       (215, 7, 5, N'fought with Ehlec Teroh, but General Long', 27),
       (215, 7, 6, N'lost. It''s hard to believe that Ehlec Teroh has ', 27),
       (215, 7, 7, N'such awesome power...', 1),
       (215, 9, 0, N'Recently, Frozen Maidens have appeared in ', 1),
       (215, 9, 1, N'Migong Valley to the North East. They''re going to', 1),
       (215, 9, 2, N'be another strong force!!', 1),
       (216, 0, 0, N'This mission is to get a report from Bhuhu in ', 1),
       (216, 0, 1, N'Hisakata Caverns. Recently, Ehlec Teroh''s Nangin ', 1),
       (216, 0, 2, N'have potential betrayers joining them against our', 1),
       (216, 0, 3, N'Guardian''s knowledge. As you can see, this report', 1),
       (216, 0, 4, N'is very important. Hisakata Caverns is a cave ', 1),
       (216, 0, 5, N'in Migong Valley. Act quickly.', 1),
       (216, 1, 0, N'Hisakata Caverns is a cave in Migong Valley,', 2),
       (216, 1, 1, N'Bhuhu should be there.', 1),
       (216, 1, 2, N'Act quickly.', 1),
       (216, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (216, 1, 5, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (216, 1, 6, N'Hisakata Caverns - Migong Valley <8202, 1619>', 34),
       (216, 1, 7, N'Messenger Bhuhu coordinates - ', 34),
       (216, 1, 8, N'Hisakata Caverns <2520, 4305>', 1),
       (216, 2, 0, N'It''s the regular report,', 1),
       (216, 2, 1, N'Ehlec Teroh''s Nangin are growing.', 1),
       (216, 2, 2, N'Details are in the Report,', 27),
       (216, 2, 3, N'Give this Report to Elder Deison .', 2),
       (216, 2, 4, N'Ehlec Teroh has recruited a lot of masters from', 2),
       (216, 2, 5, N'the Guanyin and Jinong.', 1),
       (216, 2, 6, N'I fear, many of our masters will be joining as', 1),
       (216, 2, 7, N'well... ', 27),
       (216, 7, 0, N'I am sorry to trouble you. Thank you for the', 1),
       (216, 7, 1, N'report. Uh... I heard that as well. It may be ', 1),
       (216, 7, 2, N'possible that some of our masters have an ', 1),
       (216, 7, 3, N'ulterior motive... Let me read this Report. Umm,', 27),
       (216, 7, 4, N'you can go back to have some rest. Thanks again.', 27),
       (216, 9, 0, N'Hey, come here! It''s me, Guard Captain Fashu!', 1),
       (216, 9, 1, N'Get a report from Bhuhu in the Hisakata Caverns.', 1),
       (216, 9, 2, N'Yes, that''s right, Bhuhu is in the ', 1),
       (216, 9, 3, N'Hisakata Caverns.', 1),
       (217, 0, 0, N'Bhuhu''s Report is true. Recently, some Fujin', 1),
