       (217, 0, 4, N'a creature that looks like a big crab. Lately it', 1),
       (217, 0, 5, N'has been causing trouble all over. You can find', 1),
       (217, 0, 6, N'it hiding in Migong Valley or Hisakata Caverns. ', 2),
       (217, 0, 7, N'Go and finish it, but you might want to take your', 1),
       (217, 0, 8, N'friends, he is quite tough. ', 1),
       (217, 1, 0, N'the Traveling Sanctuary is hiding in ', 2),
       (217, 1, 1, N'Migong Valley or Hisakata Caverns, ', 1),
       (217, 1, 2, N'It''s better to go with your friends.', 1),
       (217, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (217, 1, 6, N'The Traveling Sanctuaries are unique, they don''t', 34),
       (217, 1, 7, N'come in big numbers. You will find them in ', 34),
       (217, 1, 8, N'Migong Valley to the East. ', 34),
       (217, 1, 9, N'You may abandon the mission if you wish to.', 34),
       (217, 7, 0, N'Good, job well done. We are still looking into ', 1),
       (217, 7, 1, N'the report, you don''t have to worry.', 1),
       (217, 7, 2, N'Go back now and have some rest.', 1),
       (217, 8, 0, N'That''s it, you can give up if you want to.', 1),
       (217, 8, 1, N'Maybe you need a rest.', 1),
       (217, 9, 0, N'Kill The Traveling Sanctuary in Migong Valley or ', 1),
       (217, 9, 1, N'Hisakata Caverns. You may want to bring your ', 1),
       (217, 9, 2, N'friends. I have to take care of those betrayers, ', 1),
       (217, 9, 3, N'so I''m really tied up.', 1),
       (218, 0, 0, N'The letter indicated that all betrayers who ', 1),
       (218, 0, 1, N'intend to join the Nangin would be killed. I''m ', 1),
       (218, 0, 2, N'sure Ehlec Teroh has been informed of this ', 1),
