       (222, 7, 2, N'it looks like the Nangin will get masters from', 27),
       (222, 7, 3, N'all 3 major Factions. This is terrible!', 27),
       (222, 7, 4, N'How can Ehlec Teroh lead them... ', 27),
       (222, 7, 5, N'Stay in good shape, be ready for a strike at any', 27),
       (222, 7, 6, N'time. What will become of our world?', 27),
       (222, 9, 0, N'I''m Songsmith Seiren, come here.', 1),
       (222, 9, 1, N'I need you go to Migong Valley to the North West,', 1),
       (222, 9, 2, N'and kill those useless creatures.', 1),
