       (260, 9, 3, N'They became well known during Legacy Warrior''s', 1),
       (260, 9, 4, N'Battle with the 12 Legions.', 1),
       (261, 0, 0, N'You''re now ready for the Siyun Grounds.', 1),
       (261, 0, 1, N'From now on, Nangin minions may be involved ', 1),
       (261, 0, 2, N'in every battle, making it more risky, and the', 27),
       (261, 0, 3, N'occupying method will be different. You must ', 27),
       (261, 0, 4, N'prepare yourself. When it''s time, go to ', 1),
