       (261, 8, 2, N'conditions... I don''t need a useless creature.', 1),
       (261, 9, 0, N'I''m Songsmith Seiren. Today, the war is no longer', 1),
       (261, 9, 1, N'the same. Some special enemies will', 1),
       (261, 9, 2, N'be involved. Hahahaha....', 1),
       (262, 0, 0, N'After the Legacy Warrior''s battle with the 12', 1),
       (262, 0, 1, N'Legion, a lot thingshave  happened. First the ', 1),
       (262, 0, 2, N'Nangin''s rise and then its demise to ', 1),
       (262, 0, 3, N'Mt. Changbaishan. Then came the senseless war', 1),
       (262, 0, 4, N'between all the Factions. Then years later, the  ', 1),
       (262, 0, 5, N'proclamation of hope brought by Ehlec Teroh, and', 1),
       (262, 0, 6, N'finally I hear that the Nangin''s 12 High Masters', 1),
       (262, 0, 7, N'have returned, bringing the final trials ', 1),
       (262, 0, 8, N'So, everyone now believes its better', 1),
       (262, 0, 9, N'to stick together. I gave the investigation to', 1),
       (262, 0, 10, N'Beggar Shu of Saigo Temple. The ', 1),
