       (262, 2, 1, N'Sh, here you are, just go!', 1),
       (262, 2, 2, N'... I''m just a beggar, you have me all wrong!', 1),
       (262, 7, 0, N'Did anyone see you? Huh, sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (262, 7, 1, N'Let me check... ', 1),
       (262, 7, 2, N'You know, Guanyin is facing the same ', 27),
       (262, 7, 3, N'trouble. A lot of their disciples are leaving to', 27),
       (262, 7, 4, N'join the Nangin. Ugh, all of this is giving me a', 27),
       (262, 7, 5, N'headache. I have to report this to Elder Deison.', 27),
       (262, 9, 0, N'Can you come over here?', 1),
       (262, 9, 1, N'I need you to go to Saigo Temple and', 1),
       (262, 9, 2, N'bring me an important item from Beggar Shu.', 1),
