       (291, 0, 2, N'I met a monster called White Ape Alpha Male.', 1),
       (291, 0, 3, N'He is so powerful, and I''m just a girl. ', 1),
       (291, 0, 4, N'All I can do is to run away... ', 1),
       (291, 0, 5, N'I have to go to Ronyan Fortress again, but I''m ', 1),
       (291, 0, 6, N'worried.  Can you kill it for me? He is hiding in', 2),
       (291, 0, 7, N'Ronyan Fortress, disguised as a dead white ape.', 2),
       (291, 0, 8, N'Thank you!', 27),
       (291, 1, 0, N'White Ape Alpha Male is hiding somwhere around ', 1),
       (291, 1, 1, N'Ronyan Fortress.  You have to search carefully.', 1),
       (291, 1, 2, N'He is disguised a dead white monkey.', 2),
       (291, 1, 3, N'You can tell when you see him.', 1),
       (291, 1, 4, N'Just do your sister a favor...', 1),
       (291, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (291, 1, 7, N'Mission target ''White Ape Alpha Male'' is in', 34),
       (291, 1, 8, N'Ronyan Fortress to the South West, <5567, 18018>.', 34),
       (291, 7, 0, N'Aha......I always believed you could make it.', 1),
       (291, 7, 1, N'I really thank you.', 1),
       (291, 7, 2, N'Why do you look so sad?', 1),
       (291, 7, 3, N'Maybe I got it wrong...if I said the wrong thing,', 1),
       (291, 7, 4, N'I hope you can understand.', 1),
       (291, 7, 5, N'Thank you so much! ', 1),
       (291, 9, 0, N'Please help me.', 1),
       (291, 9, 1, N'I''m in trouble,', 1),
       (291, 9, 2, N'Can you kill the White Ape Alpha Male for me?', 1),
       (292, 0, 0, N'How do you do? How are you getting on recently? ', 1),
       (292, 0, 1, N'As you must know by now, we have all been facing', 1),
       (292, 0, 2, N'challenges of the Nangin.  Recently the three', 1),
       (292, 0, 3, N'major Factions have united together.  Yet the ', 27),
       (292, 0, 4, N'Jinong are still losing to the minions of the ', 27),
       (292, 0, 5, N'Nangin. Now, many enemies are showing up in ', 1),
       (292, 0, 6, N'Ronyan Fortress.  Their leader is called ', 1),
       (292, 0, 7, N'Arachnid Hybrid. They like to hide in the bushes ', 1),
       (292, 0, 8, N'on the roadside''s East Gate and making surprise ', 1),
       (292, 0, 9, N'attacks. Go and stop it, I don''t want to ', 1),
       (292, 1, 0, N'If you kill the Arachnid Hybrid,', 1),
       (292, 1, 1, N'their arrogence will be dampened.', 1),
       (292, 1, 2, N'We can have peace now, haha.', 2),
       (292, 1, 3, N'Arachnid Hybrid is hiding in Ronyan Fortress ', 2),
       (292, 1, 4, N'around the East Gate bush.', 1),
       (292, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (292, 1, 6, N'Mission target the ''Arachnid Hybrid'' is in ', 34),
       (292, 1, 7, N'Ronyan Fortress to the South East <12461, 17106>.', 34),
       (292, 7, 0, N'Hahaha... among the people I have seen,', 1),
       (292, 7, 1, N'you have the most protential.', 1),
       (292, 7, 2, N'Step by step, you will reach your goal!', 1),
       (292, 7, 3, N'Hahahaha....wahahaha!!', 1),
       (292, 7, 4, N' ', 1),
       (292, 9, 0, N'Humph, Arachnid Hybrid......come to me quickly!', 1),
       (292, 9, 1, N'Go and teach him a lesson for me!', 1),
       (293, 0, 0, N'You''re very good.  In fact, you''re one of the', 1),
       (293, 0, 1, N'bravest warriors I have ever seen. You can do ', 1),
       (293, 0, 2, N'this job for sure. Those creatures called ', 1),
       (293, 0, 3, N'Necromantic Monks are wandering outside the city ', 1),
       (293, 0, 4, N'right now! Thats the undisguised nuisance to ', 1),
       (293, 0, 5, N'Ronyan Fortress! Go and kill them!!', 1),
       (293, 0, 6, N'40! Kill 40 Necromantic Monks!', 1),
       (293, 0, 7, N'Let''s give it our all!!!', 2),
       (293, 0, 8, N'Exit from Ronyan Fortress''s North Gate, heading', 2),
       (293, 0, 9, N'towards the North, and you will meet them!', 1),
       (293, 1, 0, N'Exit from Ronyan Fortress''s North Gate, heading  ', 1),
       (293, 1, 1, N'towards the North, and you will meet them! ', 2),
       (293, 1, 2, N'Kill 40 of them!  Hey, be careful, it maybe', 1),
       (293, 1, 3, N'a lasting fight for you.', 1),
       (293, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (293, 1, 6, N'''Necromantic Monks'' are in Ronyan Fortress area', 34),
       (293, 1, 7, N'East Gate <12656, 12663>', 34),
       (293, 1, 8, N'North Gate <8506, 11226>', 34),
       (293, 1, 9, N'West Gate <3917, 12325> ', 34),
       (293, 7, 0, N'I''m sorry to trouble you!', 1),
       (293, 7, 1, N'Haha, that''s quite a murderous look!', 1),
       (293, 7, 2, N'A bit scary, haha.', 1),
       (293, 7, 3, N'Thank you!', 1),
       (293, 9, 0, N'Hey! This is Elder Sha-Tian''s order! Come ', 1),
       (293, 9, 1, N'over quickly!!  No mercy to our enemies!', 1),
       (293, 9, 2, N'Kill those enemies wandering outside the city!', 1),
       (294, 0, 0, N'Why does such misery happen to you?', 1),
       (294, 0, 1, N'Uh, I believe people in this city must be ', 1),
       (294, 0, 2, N'interested...  Well, I have already told you,', 1),
       (294, 0, 3, N'go to Herbalist Yucha.', 27),
       (294, 0, 4, N'He will tell you what you want to know,', 2),
       (294, 1, 0, N'If you''re lucky enough, the Guardian will be', 1),
       (294, 1, 1, N'surpassed as well!  Haha, this is life, its fun!', 1),
       (294, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (294, 1, 6, N'Herbalist Yucha is in Ronyan Fortress in the ', 34),
       (294, 1, 7, N'central area <8932, 17478>. ', 34),
       (294, 1, 8, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (294, 7, 0, N'Well... what took you so long?', 1),
       (294, 7, 1, N'Come on, let me take a look. ', 1),
       (294, 7, 2, N'You''re really a spirit...', 1),
       (294, 7, 3, N'Even in this...you''re unique, but does it matter?', 1),
       (294, 7, 4, N'You must learn to go beyond your potential, and', 1),
       (294, 7, 5, N'you will learn to survive! Do not be afraid, use ', 1),
       (294, 7, 6, N'your power! Uh, only you, me, and Elder Sha-Tian ', 27),
       (294, 7, 7, N'knows the secret of your body. Don''t tell anyone,', 27),
       (294, 7, 8, N'or you will be in trouble.', 1),
       (294, 9, 0, N'How have you been? Come to me.', 1),
       (294, 9, 1, N'Do you want to know the condition of your body?', 1),
       (295, 0, 0, N'According to an insider, Goblinkin Soldiers plan ', 1),
       (295, 0, 1, N'to attack us.  They have reached the city to the ', 1),
       (295, 0, 2, N'North, above the Necromantic Monk''s position.  ', 1),
       (295, 0, 3, N'Just go there and kill 40 of them, that will do.', 2),
       (295, 0, 4, N'I hope you won''t let me down, return in triumph.', 2),
       (295, 1, 0, N'Their position is above Necromantic Monks.', 1),
       (295, 1, 1, N'Go there and finish them. Although it''s only 40', 2),
       (295, 1, 2, N'of them, don''t take a long time battling them.', 1),
       (295, 1, 3, N'You have to go for it to prove your strength!', 1),
       (295, 1, 4, N'I will be waiting for you over here!', 27),
       (295, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (295, 1, 7, N'''Goblinkin Soldier'' are in Ronyan Fortress ', 34),
       (295, 1, 8, N'central to the North <5747, 10486>,', 34),
       (295, 1, 9, N'right side of the road <8243, 10397>', 34),
       (295, 1, 10, N'you will find them easily.', 34),
       (295, 7, 0, N'Haha, I''m sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (295, 7, 1, N'It seems, you are better than Dark Demon!', 27),
       (295, 7, 2, N'Well... tough spirit!', 1),
       (295, 7, 3, N'Take it.', 1),
       (295, 9, 0, N'Come over to me.', 1),
       (295, 9, 1, N'Recently, a Corp of Goblinkin Soldiers have been ', 1),
       (295, 9, 2, N'seen here. They said they will attack our city.', 1),
       (295, 9, 3, N'I knew you would be interested!', 1),
       (296, 0, 0, N'Hey! Guanyin and Fujin ', 1);
INSERT INTO world.QuestSpeeches (QuestId, SpeechKind, LineIndex, Text, Color)
VALUES (296, 0, 1, N'are coming again! It''s difficult, they''re also', 1),
       (296, 0, 2, N'short handed, but... oh, don''t waste time, just ', 1),
       (296, 0, 3, N'go to Bui Di Grounds by me. Huh, what?', 1),
       (296, 0, 4, N'Just kill Guanyin and Fujin!', 1),
       (296, 0, 5, N'If we win, it''s not just our honor, it''s ', 1),
       (296, 0, 6, N'your honor as well! Don''t worry, only level ', 1),
       (296, 0, 7, N'10-19 are allowed to fight, no risks.', 2),
       (296, 1, 0, N'Go to Bui Di Grounds if you have time.', 1),
       (296, 1, 1, N'Win the battle by finishing off the Fujin ', 1),
       (296, 1, 2, N'and the Guanyin! Don''t worry, ', 1),
       (296, 1, 3, N'only level 10-19 are allowed to fight, so no', 30),
       (296, 1, 4, N'risks.', 34),
       (296, 1, 6, N' ** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (296, 1, 7, N'Bui Di Grounds only citizens with  ', 34),
       (296, 1, 8, N'level 10-19 are allowed to enter. A combat ', 34),
       (296, 1, 9, N'hotspot (takes place each hour). When the time ', 1),
       (296, 1, 10, N'comes, go there by Guard Captain Tuo or prompt ', 1),
       (296, 1, 11, N'window. Win the battel by surviving until all ', 1),
       (296, 1, 12, N'enemies are killed. ', 1),
       (296, 7, 0, N'Wow! Outstanding.', 1),
       (296, 7, 1, N'Such a great achievement at this stage!', 1),
       (296, 7, 2, N'Great potential!', 1),
       (296, 7, 3, N'Your murderous look is just too much, ', 1),
       (296, 7, 4, N'its not good for progress!', 1),
       (296, 8, 0, N'Ok, thats it,', 1),
       (296, 8, 1, N'have some rest.', 1),
       (296, 9, 0, N'Please go to Ronyan Fortress''s North Gate.', 1),
       (296, 9, 1, N'A lot of experience will be rewarded if you win!', 1),
       (296, 9, 2, N'Don''t come if you don''t have any confidence!', 1),
       (297, 0, 0, N'Did you Kill White Ape Alpha Male for Fao, ', 1),
       (297, 0, 1, N'recently? No wonder Elder Sha-Tian was so ', 1),
       (297, 0, 2, N'excited! Well, this mission is for you. You must ', 1),
       (297, 0, 3, N'kill a Disloyal Maiden.  Disloyal Maidens were ', 1),
       (297, 0, 4, N'the maids of a tribe who were worshiping the God ', 1),
       (297, 0, 5, N'of water, but for some unknown reason, they have ', 1),
       (297, 0, 6, N'come under some dark magic... They''re just ', 1),
       (297, 0, 7, N'cowards, finish of one of them, and the rest will', 1),
       (297, 0, 8, N'be under your command. Go on, they''re hiding ', 1),
       (297, 0, 9, N'in the Ronyan Fortress area.', 1),
       (297, 1, 0, N'They''re hiding in the Ronyan Fortress area.', 1),
       (297, 1, 1, N'You need to search carefully to find them.', 1),
       (297, 1, 2, N'They were the maidens of the God of Water, ', 27),
       (297, 1, 3, N'therefore they dress differently. Just kill one, ', 27),
       (297, 1, 4, N'that will do. Thank you.', 2),
       (297, 1, 7, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (297, 1, 8, N'Disloyal Maidens are unique, they don''t come ', 34),
       (297, 1, 9, N'in big numbers. They''re in Ronyan Fortress to ', 34),
       (297, 1, 10, N'the North. You will find them easily, but ', 34),
       (297, 1, 11, N'remember, they have plenty of Vitality, ', 1),
       (297, 1, 12, N'so be careful. ', 1),
       (297, 7, 0, N'You really are a credit to Elder Sha-Tian''s ', 1),
       (297, 7, 1, N'expectation.  You remind me of the Guardian when ', 1),
       (297, 7, 2, N'he was young.  We are looking forward to ', 27),
       (297, 7, 3, N'seeing that.  I''m too old, haha....', 27),
       (297, 7, 4, N'You don''t look so good, get some rest.', 1),
       (297, 8, 0, N'I''ll take care of it, give up if you want to...', 1),
       (297, 9, 0, N'Can you come to me?', 1),
       (297, 9, 1, N'I want you to take care of Disloyal Maidens...', 1),
       (297, 9, 2, N'They''re in Ronyan Fortress position,', 1),
       (297, 9, 3, N'It should not be difficult for you to handle.', 1),
       (298, 0, 0, N'Hey, long time no see! Ok, its urgent, ', 1),
       (298, 0, 1, N'so I''ll get straight to the point.', 1),
       (298, 0, 2, N'Exiled Vagabondss were Guanyin''s warriors.', 1),
       (298, 0, 3, N'Recently they declared to break off from our ', 27),
       (298, 0, 4, N'Faction. The Guardian feels there must be someone', 1),
       (298, 0, 5, N'behind this. You must go and kill 5 of their ', 1),
       (298, 0, 6, N'Chiefs, that should do it.  They''re hiding in the', 1),
       (298, 0, 7, N'last bridge of Ronyan Fortress to the North!', 1),
       (298, 1, 0, N'Exiled Vagabond Chiefs looks like ordinary ', 1),
       (298, 1, 1, N'Vagabonds, but you can spot them if you watch ', 1),
       (298, 1, 2, N'carefully. Go and kill 5 ''Exiled Vagabond Chiefs''', 1),
       (298, 1, 3, N'They''re hiding in the last bridge of ', 2),
       (298, 1, 4, N'Ronyan Fortress to the North!', 1),
       (298, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (298, 1, 7, N'Exiled Vagabond Chief looks like ordinary ', 34),
       (298, 1, 8, N'Vagabonds,but you can spot them if you watch ', 34),
       (298, 1, 9, N'carefully. They usually appear in ', 34),
       (298, 1, 10, N'Ronyan Fortress to the North <6903, 5447>, they ', 1),
       (298, 1, 11, N'always mix with other Exiles, those foes will ', 1),
       (298, 1, 12, N'not provide Experience and items. Only citizens ', 1),
       (298, 1, 13, N'in this mission should attack them.', 1),
       (298, 7, 0, N'Sorry to trouble you!', 1),
       (298, 7, 1, N'but, please get rid of that murderous look.', 1),
       (298, 7, 2, N'That will make you more approachable. By the way,', 1),
       (298, 7, 3, N'you really are showing off your ability too much.', 1),
       (298, 7, 4, N'Haha, eh, I''m talking too much, just go back ', 1),
       (298, 7, 5, N'and have some rest.', 1),
       (298, 9, 0, N'It''s me, Guard Captain Tuo. Can you come quickly?', 1),
       (298, 9, 1, N'Can you take care of The Exiled Vagabond Chief ', 1),
       (298, 9, 2, N'for me? They are really troublesome.', 1),
       (299, 0, 0, N'I had a friend, a beggar when I was young, who ', 1),
       (299, 0, 1, N'was killed by Mercenaries...', 27),
       (299, 0, 2, N'I want to take revenge, but I can''t make it...', 27),
       (299, 0, 3, N'I cant do anything at all...', 1),
       (299, 0, 4, N'Would you please help this poor old man, and', 1),
       (299, 0, 5, N'go and kill some Mercenaries!', 1),
       (299, 0, 6, N'They''re in Ronyan Fortress to the North,', 1),
       (299, 0, 7, N'40, kill 40, that will do...', 2),
       (299, 1, 0, N'Mercenaries are in Ronyan Fortress to the ', 1),
       (299, 1, 1, N'North.  Please fulfill my wish!', 2),
       (299, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (299, 1, 5, N'''Mercenaries'' are in the Ronyan Fortress   ', 34),
       (299, 1, 6, N'area to the North <9005, 3873> ', 34),
       (299, 1, 7, N'you will spot them easily.', 34),
       (299, 7, 0, N'Haha... thank you so much.', 1),
       (299, 7, 1, N'It dosen''t cost much, just to show my regards.', 1),
       (299, 7, 2, N'Ronyan Fortress citizens says thay can sense the ', 1),
       (299, 7, 3, N'evil in you, but an old beggar cant tell.', 1),
       (299, 7, 4, N'Thank you anyway.', 27),
       (299, 9, 0, N'Huh... are you that famous guy?', 1),
       (299, 9, 1, N'Can you come over?', 1),
       (299, 9, 2, N'Please fulfill my wish!', 1),
       (300, 0, 0, N'You must win this battle!', 1),
       (300, 0, 1, N'Ooh! help me with this! With you, we can make it!', 1),
       (300, 0, 2, N'You can enter the Desati Grounds ', 1),
       (300, 0, 3, N'battle by me! Unlike the Bui Di Grounds', 1),
       (300, 0, 4, N' battle, here, you only need to break the', 2),
       (300, 0, 5, N'other Faction''s stone!  Therefore you''re going to', 2),
       (300, 0, 6, N'need better tactics.  Don''t worry, there is', 1),
       (300, 0, 7, N'a level limitation here as well, no risks.', 1),
       (300, 0, 8, N'You may give up if you haven''t any confidence ', 1),
       (300, 0, 9, N'. ', 1),
       (300, 1, 0, N'Reach Desati Grounds.', 1),
       (300, 1, 1, N'Win the battle by breaking the stone of the ', 1),
       (300, 1, 2, N'other Factions.  Not to worry, this mission', 1),
       (300, 1, 3, N' has the (20-29) level limitation.', 30),
       (300, 1, 7, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (300, 1, 8, N'Only citizens of level 20-29 are allowed to fight', 34),
       (300, 1, 9, N'Desati Grounds. A combat hotspot.', 34),
       (300, 1, 10, N'(Takes place each hour). You can enter by ', 1),
       (300, 1, 11, N'Guard Captain Tuo or the prompt window. Factions', 1),
       (300, 1, 12, N'who can keep the stone till the end will win. ', 1),
       (300, 1, 13, N'You will be eliminated others break the stone. ', 1),
       (300, 7, 0, N'Haha! Your murderous look put the pressure ', 1),
       (300, 7, 1, N'on your opponent! Victory is for sure, right?', 1),
       (300, 7, 2, N'Aha! Just kidding, just kidding.', 1),
       (300, 7, 3, N'Oh, can you show some expression? Dang...', 1),
       (300, 7, 4, N'Sorry, take it, its for you, just take it.', 1),
       (300, 7, 5, N' I''m so glad!', 1),
       (300, 8, 0, N'Huh...am I expecting too much?', 1),
       (300, 8, 1, N'Forget it....go get rest.', 1),
       (300, 9, 0, N'Help me out! I need some extra hands!', 1),
       (300, 9, 1, N'Well! Just for your information, ', 1),
       (300, 9, 2, N'you will be rewarded if you win!!', 1),
       (301, 0, 0, N'Don''t show such a weird experssion.', 1),
       (301, 0, 1, N'I''m Tailor Vehl Kei.', 1),
       (301, 0, 2, N'Hey, a lot of materials been taken by the ', 1),
       (301, 0, 3, N'Desert Dwellers recently, I cannot produce enough', 1),
       (301, 0, 4, N'cloth. Many people are unhappy about this ', 1),
       (301, 0, 5, N'situation. Please recover the Silk Fabric for me.', 1),
       (301, 0, 6, N'Just kill Desert Dwellers and you will find it.  ', 1),
       (301, 0, 7, N'Dont worry about the reward. You''ll like it.', 1),
       (301, 0, 8, N'Desert Dwellers appear in the Daoba Forest to', 1),
       (301, 0, 9, N'the North West. You must not lose!', 1),
       (301, 1, 0, N'Don''t underestimate Desert Dwellers. They usually', 1),
       (301, 1, 1, N'appear in the Daoba Forest to the South West.', 1),
       (301, 1, 2, N'Catch them and you will find the Silk Fabric.', 2),
       (301, 1, 3, N'Thank you.', 1),
       (301, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (301, 1, 7, N'''Desert Dwellers'' are in the Daoba Forest to the', 34),
       (301, 1, 8, N'South West at <3971, 12939> you will find them.', 34),
       (301, 1, 9, N'''Silk Fabric'' is a mission item, catch ', 34),
       (301, 1, 10, N'Desert Dwellers and it will appear.', 34),
       (301, 1, 11, N'Bring it back.', 34),
       (301, 7, 0, N'I knew you could make it!', 1),
       (301, 7, 1, N'Haha! It''s not expensive, but its my best.', 1),
       (301, 7, 2, N'Did you want to have tea with me, somtime?', 1),
       (301, 7, 3, N'On my treat, of course!', 1),
       (301, 7, 4, N'So, see you then.', 1),
       (301, 8, 0, N'What, you really gave up?', 1),
       (301, 8, 1, N'I got it, a bit disappointed, but no choice.', 1),
       (301, 9, 0, N'Can you come to the tailor shop?', 1),
       (301, 9, 1, N'I hope you can recover the Silk Fabric,', 1),
       (301, 9, 2, N'Find the Daoba Forest to the North West''s ', 1),
       (301, 9, 3, N'Desert Dwellers.', 1),
       (302, 0, 0, N'I''m sorry, there is an important', 1),
       (302, 0, 1, N'letter to Elder Sha-Tian.  Only you can', 1),
       (302, 0, 2, N'take this job. Go to Tai and have him', 1),
       (302, 0, 3, N'send you to Saigo Temple,', 1),
       (302, 0, 4, N'then get the letter from Gate Master Ling.', 1),
       (302, 0, 5, N'You have to deliver it to Elder Sha-Tian!', 1),
       (302, 1, 0, N'Go see the Gate Master and let Tai send you to', 1),
       (302, 1, 1, N'Saigo Temple, and get letter from Gate', 1),
       (302, 1, 2, N'Master Ling.  You have to deliver it to ', 1),
       (302, 1, 3, N'Elder Sha-Tian!', 2),
       (302, 1, 7, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (302, 1, 8, N'Saigo Temple can only be reached by', 34),
       (302, 1, 9, N'Gate Master Tai.  Gate Master Tai is ', 34),
       (302, 1, 10, N'at <9846, 18227>. You will see Gate Master Ling ', 34),
       (302, 1, 11, N'once you have reached Saigo Temple. ', 1),
       (302, 1, 12, N'Gate Master Ling is at <3301, 5572>. ', 1),
       (302, 1, 13, N'Elder Sha-Tian is at <8757, 19487>.', 1),
       (302, 2, 0, N'Huh, why are you here? Well, you''re very good at ', 1),
       (302, 2, 1, N'looking fierce. I can tell it in a glance, haha.', 1),
       (302, 2, 2, N'I heard the Fujin has a new Guardian,', 1),
       (302, 2, 3, N'this letter has the details.', 1),
       (302, 2, 4, N'Please give this letter to Elder Sha-Tian.', 1),
       (302, 7, 0, N'Haha...... here you are.', 1),
       (302, 7, 1, N'Huh, let me check this letter.', 1),
       (302, 7, 2, N'What? Fohchoy is the new Guardian?', 1),
       (302, 7, 3, N'Uh? What happened with the Fujin?', 27),
       (302, 7, 4, N'Interesting, I have to talk to the Guardian.', 27),
       (302, 7, 5, N'You may go now.', 27),
       (302, 9, 0, N'Hey! Hurry up! It''s me, Tuo! Hurry!', 1),
       (302, 9, 1, N'Go to Saigo Temple and find Gate Master Ling.', 1),
