       (399, 1, 1, N'speaking to Tuo. Be careful, it''s dangerous,  ', 1),
       (399, 1, 2, N'and other enemies will appear. You may give', 2),
       (399, 1, 3, N'up if you''re too scared.', 1),
       (399, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (399, 1, 7, N'Siyun Grounds only citizens of level', 34),
       (399, 1, 8, N'100-105 can enter. It''s a combat hotspot. ', 34),
       (399, 1, 9, N'(It opens for one hour each time) You can enter', 34),
       (399, 1, 10, N'by talking to Guard Captain Tuo or the prompt', 34),
       (399, 1, 11, N'window. Hold the position for 5 minutes to win.', 34),
       (399, 1, 12, N'There will be foes using Area Attacks.  It will', 1),
       (399, 1, 13, N'make the battle uncertain, so always keep ', 1),
       (399, 1, 14, N'that in mind.', 1),
       (399, 7, 0, N'You''re getting more famous. Even people from ', 27),
       (399, 7, 1, N'other Factions have heard of you. One day, you ', 1),
       (399, 7, 2, N'will be more famous than our own Lord! Haha. ', 1),
       (399, 7, 3, N'Take this Steel of Eternity, make good use of it!', 1),
       (399, 8, 0, N'That''s it, go back have some rest.', 1),
       (399, 8, 1, N'I can count on others to do this.', 1),
       (399, 9, 0, N'Just fight like before, but', 1),
       (399, 9, 1, N'be aware of hidden enemies.', 1),
       (399, 9, 2, N'By the way, other Factions will ', 1),
       (399, 9, 3, N'trouble you as well..', 1),
       (400, 0, 0, N'It''s been a long time, but I need you to help', 1),
       (400, 0, 1, N'me again. Recently, highly valued items were ', 1),
       (400, 0, 2, N'taken by the Mythical Gatekeepers. With the loss ', 1),
       (400, 0, 3, N'of these materials, it will be difficult to make ', 1),
       (400, 0, 4, N'more armor. It affects our warriors'' safety.  ', 1),
       (400, 0, 5, N'Elder Sha-Tian wanted me to come to you. He ', 1),
       (400, 0, 6, N'said that you could handle this. I want to you to', 1),
       (400, 0, 7, N'teach those Mythical Gatekeepers a lesson! ', 1),
       (400, 0, 8, N'They appear in the Sumizo Palace. Just kill one,', 1),
       (400, 0, 9, N'that will do it!', 1),
       (400, 1, 0, N'Mythical Gatekeeper are usually big in size,', 1),
       (400, 1, 1, N'making them easy to spot. They', 2),
       (400, 1, 2, N'appear in Sumizo Palace. I will be waiting for', 1),
       (400, 1, 3, N' your return!', 1),
       (400, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (400, 1, 6, N'Mythical Gatekeepers are unique, they don''t come ', 34),
       (400, 1, 7, N'in big numbers. You will find them around the ', 34),
       (400, 1, 8, N'Sumizo Palace''s East area. Be careful, they are', 1),
       (400, 1, 9, N'very powerful.', 1),
       (400, 7, 0, N'Thank you! The supply of equipment is now ', 1),
       (400, 7, 1, N'back on track.  I can feel the impending battle', 1),
       (400, 7, 2, N'approaching.  At least we have the material we', 1),
       (400, 7, 3, N' need. Haha.  Here take this, its a Red Jade,', 1),
       (400, 7, 4, N'an upgrading stone that''s better than the', 1),
       (400, 7, 5, N'Purple Jade.', 1),
       (400, 9, 0, N'Can you come to the tailor shop? I want you do ', 1),
       (400, 9, 1, N'me a favor...  The Mythical Gatekeeper has ', 1),
       (400, 9, 2, N'appeared in the Sumizo Palace.  He took my ', 1),
       (400, 9, 3, N'enchant equipment material! ', 1),
       (400, 9, 4, N'It''s very important to me.', 1),
       (401, 0, 0, N'After the defeat of the Mythical Gatekeeper,', 1),
       (401, 0, 1, N'the Dual Blade Monsters want revenge on you.', 1),
       (401, 0, 2, N'We are actively perparing for the new war, and', 1),
       (401, 0, 3, N'have no spare hands to take care of them. They''re', 1),
       (401, 0, 4, N'hiding in a in a house above the Reisuto River.', 1),
       (401, 0, 5, N'Please find them and kill them.', 1),
       (401, 1, 0, N'They''re usually hiding in a house above the ', 2),
       (401, 1, 1, N'Reisuto River.  Find them and kill them.', 1),
       (401, 1, 2, N'Come to me after you done, I will be waiting.', 2),
       (401, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 1),
       (401, 1, 5, N'''Dual Blade Monster'' is in the Reisuto River', 30),
       (401, 1, 6, N'to the South <8823, 10819>.', 34),
       (401, 7, 0, N'Unexpectedly, the Mythical Gatekeeper mutated ', 1),
       (401, 7, 1, N'into a powerful Dual Blade Monster. It would seem', 1),
       (401, 7, 2, N'the information about the Nangin having found ', 27),
       (401, 7, 3, N'mystical knowledge of the Fallen Legacy Hero', 27),
       (401, 7, 4, N'might be the truth... What makes Ehlec Teroh so ', 1),
       (401, 7, 5, N'strong? I have to talk to the Guardian...', 1),
       (401, 9, 0, N'Come quickly!', 1),
       (401, 9, 1, N'The Dual Blade Monster will usually hide in ', 1),
       (401, 9, 2, N'a house above the Reisuto River entrance. It''s ', 1),
       (401, 9, 3, N'the mutated version of the Mythical Gatekeeper,', 1),
       (401, 9, 4, N'therefore it will be even more powerful.', 1),
       (402, 0, 0, N'Sacred Blood Lords are stronger than Nightmare ', 1),
       (402, 0, 1, N'Swordsmen. These were sent to confront us.', 1),
       (402, 0, 2, N'They''re hiding in the Reisuto River, in ', 1),
       (402, 0, 3, N'Itamo Hall. They will be difficult to fight alone', 1),
       (402, 0, 4, N'because they have a powerful Area Attack.', 1),
       (402, 0, 5, N'Going with your friends would be a good choice.', 1),
       (402, 1, 0, N'The Sacred Blood Lords are hiding in ', 1),
       (402, 1, 1, N'Reisuto River, in the Itamo Hall.  It''s important', 2),
       (402, 1, 2, N'to remember that they have a strong Area Attack.', 1),
       (402, 1, 3, N'They will be difficult to fight on your own.', 30),
       (402, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (402, 1, 7, N'Sacred Blood Lords are strong! They appear in ', 34),
       (402, 1, 8, N'the Reisuto River East central area.', 1),
       (402, 1, 9, N'Their big size should make it easier for you', 1),
       (402, 1, 10, N'to find them. They have a lot of Vitality, and ', 1),
       (402, 1, 11, N'can use a powerful Area Attack. It would be', 1),
       (402, 1, 12, N'best if you went with a group.', 1),
       (402, 7, 0, N'Nightmare Swordsmen, then the Sacred Blood Lords.', 1),
       (402, 7, 1, N'Why are these creatures coming one right ', 1),
       (402, 7, 2, N'after another?  Uh, did you see that?  War has', 1),
       (402, 7, 3, N'no mercy, two former guardians were killed. ', 1),
       (402, 7, 4, N'Quon, Raji, and Nao have become the guardians.', 1),
       (402, 7, 5, N'This war has turned into an ugly ordeal...', 27),
       (402, 8, 0, N'I have it.', 1),
       (402, 8, 1, N'Go back and have some rest...', 1),
       (402, 9, 0, N'The Sacred Blood Lords have appeared in the ', 1),
       (402, 9, 1, N'Reisuto River, in the Itamo Hall. You can spot ', 1),
       (402, 9, 2, N'the weird creatures easily.', 1),
       (403, 0, 0, N'Recently, there have been changes made in our ', 1),
       (403, 0, 1, N'chain of command. A lot of dispatched Messengers', 1),
       (403, 0, 2, N'aren''t aware of this yet. This could cause ', 1),
       (403, 0, 3, N'a lot of problems. Now, most of the other areas ', 1),
       (403, 0, 4, N'have been informed, but Jianko in Itamo Hall', 1),
       (403, 0, 5, N'has not been informed yet.  You will have ', 1),
       (403, 0, 6, N'to go there and tell him personally.  Itamo Hall', 2),
       (403, 0, 7, N'is a cave linked with the Reisuto River.', 2),
       (403, 0, 8, N'Be sure to come back as soon as possible..', 1),
       (403, 1, 0, N'The Itamo Hall is a cave linked with the ', 1),
       (403, 1, 1, N'Reisuto River, if you speak with Tai, going ', 1),
       (403, 1, 2, N'to the Reisuto River will be much easier. Jianko ', 2),
       (403, 1, 3, N'is in the Itamo Hall.  Tell him about ', 1),
       (403, 1, 4, N'the changes made in the chain of command.', 1),
       (403, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (403, 1, 6, N'Itamo Hall is the cave in Reisuto River East', 34),
       (403, 1, 7, N'route coordinates <3779, 7009>.', 34),
       (403, 1, 8, N'Jianko is in Itamo Hall central - ', 1),
       (403, 1, 9, N'coordinates <3736, 5303>.', 1),
       (403, 1, 10, N'Please head towards the given map marker.', 1),
       (403, 7, 0, N'Wow! You''re that famous disciple!', 1),
       (403, 7, 1, N'It''s good to see you, I''m Messenger Jianko.', 1),
       (403, 7, 2, N'What? Our Faction has change a lot?', 1),
       (403, 7, 3, N'I have it, thank you for coming all the way here.', 1),
       (403, 7, 4, N'Be careful on your way back.', 1),
       (403, 9, 0, N'Tell Jianko about the changes made in the chain ', 1),
       (403, 9, 1, N'of command.  He is in the Itamo Hall, a cave ', 1),
       (403, 9, 2, N'linked to the Reisuto River.  If you speak with ', 1),
       (403, 9, 3, N'Tai, going to the Reisuto River ', 1),
       (403, 9, 4, N'will be much easier.', 1),
       (404, 0, 0, N'I''m sorry, but can you go to Itamo Hall again?', 1),
       (404, 0, 1, N'I have a new message. The Reanimated Master', 1),
       (404, 0, 2, N'are hurting people, and they can''t hold on much ', 1),
       (404, 0, 3, N'longer. Please, go and kill them quickly. About ', 2),
       (404, 0, 4, N'80 should do the job.  Report to me after you ', 2),
       (404, 0, 5, N'have finished. ', 1),
       (404, 1, 0, N'Kill the Reanimated Masters in the Itamo Hall ', 1),
       (404, 1, 1, N'for me. About 80 should do the job.', 1),
       (404, 1, 2, N'Report to me after you have finished the task. ', 2),
       (404, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 1),
       (404, 1, 5, N'This mission is to kill the Reanimated Master in ', 1),
       (404, 1, 6, N'the Itamo Hall.', 1),
       (404, 1, 7, N'The Reanimated Master are in the Itamo Hall ', 1),
       (404, 1, 8, N'central - <3238, 5838>. You will find them there.', 1),
       (404, 1, 9, N'** Special Coordinates **', 1),
       (404, 1, 10, N'Itamo Hall - Reisuto River <3779, 7009>', 1),
       (404, 7, 0, N'Well, mission accomplished.', 1),
       (404, 7, 1, N'I''m sorry to trouble you, I know you have ', 1),
       (404, 7, 2, N'been busy.  It''s just that we only have limited ', 1),
       (404, 7, 3, N'disciples, so it feels more nerve-racking than ', 1),
       (404, 7, 4, N'ever. I also have to work harder to improve ', 1),
       (404, 7, 5, N'myself.', 1),
       (404, 9, 0, N'You are the only choice I have for this mission.', 1),
       (404, 9, 1, N'Kill the Reanimated Master in the Itamo Hall.', 1),
       (404, 9, 2, N'There isn''t anyone else I would choose...', 1),
       (405, 0, 0, N'You''re ready for the Chal Fi Grounds ', 1),
       (405, 0, 1, N'battle.  From now on, the Nangin may be ', 1),
       (405, 0, 2, N'involved in every battle, making it more risky, ', 1),
       (405, 0, 3, N'and the occupying method will be different. ', 1),
       (405, 0, 4, N'Ok, you must prepare yourself, and watch out ', 1),
       (405, 0, 5, N'for other enemies. When its time, speak with ', 1),
       (405, 0, 6, N'Tuo, and go to Chal Fi Grounds. ', 1),
       (405, 0, 7, N'Let us fight together for the glory!', 1),
       (405, 1, 0, N'When its time, go to Chal Fi Grounds', 1),
       (405, 1, 1, N'by talking to Tuo. Be careful, its risky.', 1),
       (405, 1, 2, N'You may give up if you''re too scared.', 1),
       (405, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (405, 1, 6, N'Chal Fi Grounds only level 106-112', 34),
       (405, 1, 7, N'citizens are allowed to enter. It''s a combat ', 34),
       (405, 1, 8, N'hotspot. (It opens for one hour each time) When', 34),
       (405, 1, 9, N'it''s time, you may enter by talking to Guard ', 34),
       (405, 1, 10, N'Captain Tuo or via the prompt windows. Hold the', 34),
       (405, 1, 11, N'position for 5 minutes to win. Remember, there ', 34);
INSERT INTO world.QuestSpeeches (QuestId, SpeechKind, LineIndex, Text, Color)
VALUES (405, 1, 12, N'will be foes who can use Area Attacks. This will ', 34),
       (405, 1, 13, N'make the battle uncertain, so always keep that', 1),
       (405, 1, 14, N'in mind. ', 1),
       (405, 7, 0, N'You''re getting more famous, even people from ', 1),
       (405, 7, 1, N'other Factions have heard about you. One day,', 1),
       (405, 7, 2, N'you will be more famous than our Lord! Haha. ', 1),
       (405, 7, 3, N'Here, take this Steel of Eternity, use it wisely!', 1),
       (405, 8, 0, N'That''s it, go back to have some rest.', 1),
       (405, 8, 1, N'I will get someone else to do it.', 1),
       (405, 9, 0, N'Just fight like before,', 1),
       (405, 9, 1, N'but be aware of hidden enemies.', 1),
       (405, 9, 2, N'By the way, other Factions may give you ', 1),
       (405, 9, 3, N'trouble you as well...', 1),
       (406, 0, 0, N'Please do me a favor, Did you know the', 1),
       (406, 0, 1, N'Reisuto River is one of the most famous places ', 27),
       (406, 0, 2, N'to grow herbs in the world?  Ugh, but right ', 27),
       (406, 0, 3, N'now the area is crawling with the Red', 1),
       (406, 0, 4, N'Flute Maidens. If they are allowed to remain ', 1),
       (406, 0, 5, N'there, soon the herbs will be in short supply. ', 1),
       (406, 0, 6, N'This will greatly affect us all, so please', 1),
       (406, 0, 7, N'go and kill ten Red Flute Maidens, you must', 1),
       (406, 0, 8, N' teach them a hard lesson!  They''re hiding in the', 1),
       (406, 0, 9, N'entire Reisuto River area.  Remember, they can ', 2),
       (406, 0, 10, N'attack over a long distance, so be careful.', 1),
       (406, 1, 0, N'The Red Flute Maidens can attack over ', 1),
       (406, 1, 1, N'a long distance. Please go and kill ten of them.', 1),
       (406, 1, 2, N'You must save the herb supply!', 1),
       (406, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (406, 1, 6, N'The Red Flute Maidens are hanging around', 34),
       (406, 1, 7, N'Reisuto River. They attack by using the tone ', 34),
       (406, 1, 8, N'of a flute over long distances, so be careful!', 34),
       (406, 7, 0, N'Wow, I''m sorry to trouble you so often.', 1),
       (406, 7, 1, N'Thanks to you, we can have the Reisuto River ', 1),
       (406, 7, 2, N'supply again.  Thanks, I owe you a lot! ', 1),
       (406, 8, 0, N'Bah! I got it, so get lost.', 1),
       (406, 8, 1, N'I will write this into my report.', 1),
       (406, 9, 0, N'Come here.', 1),
       (406, 9, 1, N'The Red Flute Maidens are occupying the', 1),
       (406, 9, 2, N'Reisuto River.  ', 1),
       (406, 9, 3, N'They are affecting our herb supplies!', 1),
       (407, 0, 0, N'Our challengers have sent Broadsword Mercenary to', 1),
       (407, 0, 1, N'the Reisuto River.  Messenger Jianko''s report', 1),
       (407, 0, 2, N'shows that the creature is currently on the way', 1),
       (407, 0, 3, N'from the Itamo Hall to the Reisuto River.', 2),
       (407, 0, 4, N'It appears he can''t find his way out.  Nao''s ', 2),
       (407, 0, 5, N'report shows that one of the Gargantuan Guardians', 1),
       (407, 0, 6, N'joined forces with the Nangin and has', 1),
       (407, 0, 7, N'turned into the Broadsword Mercenary.', 1),
       (407, 0, 8, N'Compared to the Gargantuan Guardian,', 27),
       (407, 0, 9, N'he is much more powerful.', 27),
       (407, 0, 10, N'You need to be extremely careful.', 1),
       (407, 1, 0, N'Messenger Jianko''s report shows that the ', 1),
       (407, 1, 1, N'Broadsword Mercenary was on his way from the ', 1),
       (407, 1, 2, N'Itamo Hall to the Reisuto River, and now', 1),
       (407, 1, 3, N'he cant find his way out.  Compared to the ', 1),
       (407, 1, 4, N'Gargantuan Guardian, he is much more powerful.', 1),
       (407, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (407, 1, 7, N'Broadsword Mercenary - Itamo Hall ', 34),
       (407, 1, 8, N'central <4157, 4511>', 34),
       (407, 7, 0, N'Wow!', 1),
       (407, 7, 1, N'Your pride is growing with your abilities.', 1),
       (407, 7, 2, N'Now look at me, I''m trying to catch up with you.', 27),
       (407, 7, 3, N'Hahaha! You must be feeling good today.', 1),
       (407, 7, 4, N'Have a rest!', 1),
       (407, 9, 0, N'Please come here.', 1),
       (407, 9, 1, N'The Broadsword Mercenary has joined forces with ', 1),
       (407, 9, 2, N'the Nangin.  He is in the Itamo Hall.', 1),
       (407, 9, 3, N'He is not the same as the Gargantuan Guardian.', 1),
       (408, 0, 0, N'You''re here, great! I want you to do me a favor.', 1),
       (408, 0, 1, N'I''m making the antitoxic potion, but ', 1),
       (408, 0, 2, N'Herbalist Huang, from Saigo Temple, borrowed my', 1),
       (408, 0, 3, N'Medical Chest and hasnt returned it. Please go', 1),
       (408, 0, 4, N'and get it for me so I can make the antitoxic ', 1),
       (408, 0, 5, N'potion.', 2),
       (408, 1, 0, N'Bring back the Medical Chest from Herbalist Huang', 1),
       (408, 1, 1, N'at Saigo Temple for me, ', 1),
       (408, 1, 2, N'I need it to develop an antitoxic potion.', 1),
       (408, 1, 5, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (408, 1, 6, N'You may ask Gate Master Tai to use a travel ', 34),
       (408, 1, 7, N'charm on you to easily reach Saigo Temple,', 34),
       (408, 1, 8, N'but you have to pay 1,000 silver. Herbalist', 1),
       (408, 1, 9, N'Huang is in Saigo Temple <3896, 5194>.', 1),
       (408, 2, 0, N'Hah, you''re here! Hiccup...Haha...Good wine...', 1),
       (408, 2, 1, N'Here...Medical Chest...Mmm...Haha...', 1),
       (408, 2, 2, N'Wine...Good wine...', 1),
       (408, 7, 0, N'Thank you very much.', 1),
       (408, 7, 1, N'This is my Medical Chest.', 1),
       (408, 7, 2, N'I''m going to develop that antitoxic potion now,', 1),
       (408, 7, 3, N'why dont you have a rest?', 1),
       (408, 9, 0, N'Come here.', 1),
       (408, 9, 1, N'I want you to go to Saigo Temple.', 1),
       (408, 9, 2, N'Well, can you go?', 1),
       (409, 0, 0, N'It seems the Nangin plans to let Kitfo Warriors ', 1),
       (409, 0, 1, N'attack the Reisuto River. Although they''re only ', 1),
       (409, 0, 2, N'bulls, you should still take it seriously. I want', 1),
       (409, 0, 3, N'you to kill 60 of them.  By going past the ', 1),
       (409, 0, 4, N'Sumizo Palace you can reach the Reisuto River.', 2),
       (409, 0, 5, N'They are at in Reisuto River East.', 2),
       (409, 1, 0, N'Go past the Sumizo Palace to reach the Reisuto ', 1),
       (409, 1, 1, N'River. Kitfo Warriors are at in the Reisuto River', 1),
       (409, 1, 2, N'to the East. I want you to kill 60 of them.', 1),
       (409, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (409, 1, 7, N'''Kitfo Warrior'' is in the Reisuto River', 34),
       (409, 1, 8, N'East - around <9447, 8045>. You will ', 34),
       (409, 1, 9, N'find them there. This is an extremely ', 34),
       (409, 1, 10, N'tough mission, so be careful. You ', 34),
       (409, 1, 11, N'have to pass the central area to get there.', 34),
       (409, 7, 0, N'I knew you could do it. I had faith in you.', 1),
       (409, 7, 1, N'Now, I must go make a report.', 1),
       (409, 7, 2, N'Here, this Fortune Pouch is for you.', 1),
       (409, 9, 0, N'Please come here,', 1),
       (409, 9, 1, N'The Kitfo Warriors have appeared in the Reisuto ', 1),
       (409, 9, 2, N'River to the East. They really are such ', 1),
       (409, 9, 3, N'disturbing creatures.', 1),
       (410, 0, 0, N'It looks like the Mythical Gatekeepers are still ', 1),
       (410, 0, 1, N'resisting, and now they have the Holy', 1),
       (410, 0, 2, N'Sirens to help them.  I hope you are up ', 1),
       (410, 0, 3, N'for the challenge again.  Go now, and give ', 1),
       (410, 0, 4, N'them an unforgettable experience!  Holy', 1),
       (410, 0, 5, N'Sirens appear in the Reisuto River.  Just kill ', 2),
       (410, 0, 6, N'one and the Reisuto River will regain its peace.', 2),
       (410, 0, 7, N'Don''t let their beauty confuse you!', 1),
       (410, 1, 0, N'Holy Sirens appear in the Reisuto River area.', 1),
       (410, 1, 1, N'Just kill one, and the Reisuto River will regain', 2),
       (410, 1, 2, N'its peace.  Don''t let their beauty confuse you!', 1),
       (410, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (410, 1, 7, N'Holy Sirens are unique creatures, so ', 34),
       (410, 1, 8, N'they don''t come in big numbers. You will ', 34),
       (410, 1, 9, N'find them in the Reisuto River to the South...', 34),
       (410, 1, 10, N'Be careful, as they are very powerful.', 1),
       (410, 7, 0, N'Haha, good! You''re not distracted by beauty. ', 1),
       (410, 7, 1, N'You are true hero! Very well done!', 1),
       (410, 7, 2, N'This is Steel of Eternity, take it.', 1),
       (410, 7, 3, N'I will have more business for you in the future.', 1),
       (410, 9, 0, N'Come here!!', 1),
       (410, 9, 1, N'Some Holy Sirens have appeared in the', 1),
       (410, 9, 2, N'Reisuto River.  They are stunningly beautiful, ', 1),
       (410, 9, 3, N'but don''t let them confuse you!', 1),
       (411, 0, 0, N'It''s just like last time, go to Saigo Temple.', 1),
       (411, 0, 1, N'There is still not enough materials in the', 1),
       (411, 0, 2, N'Medical Chest, and I need the ''Medicated Wine''', 1),
       (411, 0, 3, N'from Herbalist Huang.  This is the treasure of ', 1),
       (411, 0, 4, N'Herbalist Huang, but it''s vital for making the', 2),
       (411, 0, 5, N'antitoxic potion.  Please, you must help me out!', 2),
       (411, 1, 0, N'Thank you for getting back the Medical Chest,', 1),
       (411, 1, 1, N'but there is not enough materials in it.  If you', 1),
       (411, 1, 2, N'can get the Medicated Wine from Herbalist Huang,', 1),
       (411, 1, 3, N'I will produce an effective antitoxic potion', 1),
       (411, 1, 4, N'for sure.', 2),
       (411, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (411, 1, 7, N'By talking to Gate Master Tai you may use his ', 34),
       (411, 1, 8, N'travel charms to easily reach Saigo Temple,', 34),
       (411, 1, 9, N'but you have to pay 1,000 silver. ', 1),
       (411, 1, 10, N'Herbalist Huang is waiting in ', 1),
       (411, 1, 11, N'Saigo Temple <3896, 5194>.', 1),
       (411, 2, 0, N'Why are you always disturbing me while I''m ', 1),
       (411, 2, 1, N'drinking...dang...What? Medicated Wine!! ', 1),
       (411, 2, 2, N'Thats my precious...!!!  Uh...? To save lives?', 1),
       (411, 2, 3, N'......', 1),
       (411, 2, 4, N'All right, here, take it...', 1),
       (411, 7, 0, N'You got it? Great! Haha, but now who am I ', 1),
       (411, 7, 1, N'suppose to thank?  Herbalist Huang or you? ', 1),
       (411, 7, 2, N'Oh well, I''m grateful either way...  I will ', 1),
       (411, 7, 3, N'develop it right now. I won''t let you down!', 1),
       (411, 9, 0, N'Come here,', 1),
       (411, 9, 1, N'Get some Medicated Wine from Herbalist Huang', 1),
       (411, 9, 2, N'for me, I need it!', 1),
       (412, 0, 0, N'The Sacred Blood Lords have come again.', 1),
       (412, 0, 1, N'Uh, again they are in the Reisuto River, in the ', 1),
       (412, 0, 2, N'Itamo Hall.  Just go and kill them all.', 1),
       (412, 0, 3, N'Oh, and be aware of their attacking range.', 1),
       (412, 1, 0, N'The Sacred Blood Lords are in Reisuto River, in', 2),
       (412, 1, 1, N'Itamo Hall.  Just kill them all, and be aware', 1),
       (412, 1, 2, N'of their attack range.', 1),
       (412, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (412, 1, 7, N'The Sacred Blood Lords are strong! They', 34),
       (412, 1, 8, N'appear in the Reisuto River East central area.', 34),
       (412, 1, 9, N'Their big size will allow you find them easily.', 34),
       (412, 1, 10, N'They have a lot of Vitality, and know a powerful ', 1),
       (412, 1, 11, N'area attack. It would be better if you went ', 1),
       (412, 1, 12, N'there with a group.', 1),
       (412, 7, 0, N'Haha, good, this is getting interesting.', 27),
       (412, 7, 1, N'Haha...check back with me to see if there ', 1),
       (412, 7, 2, N'are any future problems.', 1),
       (412, 8, 0, N'Ok, I got it.', 1),
       (412, 8, 1, N'I''ll just have to go to someone else then.', 1),
       (412, 9, 0, N'Come here,', 1),
       (412, 9, 1, N'I have a mission for you,', 1),
       (412, 9, 2, N'it''s your old friend.', 1),
       (413, 0, 0, N'The High Masters of the Nangin have sent ', 1),
       (413, 0, 1, N'Dual Hookblades to the Reisuto River.', 1),
       (413, 0, 2, N'Messenger Jianko''s report shows that just like ', 1),
       (413, 0, 3, N'the Broadsword foes, lost on the way from ', 2),
       (413, 0, 4, N'Itamo Hall to the Reisuto River, one Ghost of', 2),
       (413, 0, 5, N'Azreal has been mutated and transformed', 1),
       (413, 0, 6, N'into a Dual Hookblade. Another new ', 1),
       (413, 0, 7, N'creature created by the Nangin to test us. ', 1),
       (413, 0, 8, N'Since you have dealt with the Broadsword foes,', 1),
       (413, 0, 9, N'you are the best choice for this matter. This ', 1),
       (413, 0, 10, N'creature is stronger than the Ghost of Azreal,', 27),
       (413, 0, 11, N'so be carefull.', 27),
       (413, 1, 0, N'Messenger Jianko''s report shows that just like ', 1),
       (413, 1, 1, N'the Broadsword foes, the Dual Hookblade is on', 1),
       (413, 1, 2, N'his way from the Itamo Hall to the Reisuto', 1),
       (413, 1, 3, N'River.  These creatures are stronger than War', 1),
       (413, 1, 4, N'Specter, so be carefull.', 1),
       (413, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (413, 1, 7, N'Dual Hookblade - Itamo Hall ', 34),
       (413, 1, 8, N'South East <5771, 6305>', 34),
       (413, 7, 0, N'I''m sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (413, 7, 1, N'You really are a monster.', 1),
       (413, 7, 2, N'Hahahaha! Feeling good today?', 1),
       (413, 9, 0, N'Please come here.', 1),
       (413, 9, 1, N'Gargantuan Guardian and Ghost of Azreal have ', 1),
       (413, 9, 2, N'mutated, and it is now in Itamo Hall.  ', 1),
       (413, 9, 3, N'These beasts are stronger than Ghost of Azreal.', 1),
       (414, 0, 0, N'Such a pity, no progress has been made in making ', 1),
       (414, 0, 1, N'the antitoxic potion. It seems we need a new ', 1),
       (414, 0, 2, N'herb. Please get the ''Violet Pill'' from Beggar ', 1),
       (414, 0, 3, N'Shu of Saigo Temple, it''s good for making ', 1),
       (414, 0, 4, N'antitoxic potion.  Thank you, hurry and bring', 2),
       (414, 0, 5, N'back the herb!', 2),
       (414, 1, 0, N'Violet Pill is a good antitoxin.', 1),
       (414, 1, 1, N'Bring back the ''Violet Pill'' from Begger Zhu of ', 1),
       (414, 1, 2, N'Saigo Temple,', 1),
       (414, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (414, 1, 5, N'Talk to Gate Master Tai to use his travel charms', 34),
       (414, 1, 6, N'to move to Saigo Temple, but you have', 34),
       (414, 1, 7, N'to pay 1,000 silver.  Beggar Shu is in ', 1),
       (414, 1, 8, N'Saigo Temple <3854, 5498>.', 1),
       (414, 2, 0, N'Aha, you must have been sent by Herbalist Yucha.', 1),
       (414, 2, 1, N'I knew it! Here you are, it''s Violet Pill.', 1),
       (414, 2, 2, N'Well, I have the money, so you may go.', 1),
       (414, 7, 0, N'You made it back... Hmmm...  This looks ', 1),
       (414, 7, 1, N'like a Superior Pill, but it doesnt smell right.', 1),
       (414, 7, 2, N'How about it, you wanna try it? ', 1),
       (414, 7, 3, N'Aha, just kidding. I''m going to analyze it, ', 1),
       (414, 7, 4, N'sorry to have troubled you.', 1),
       (414, 9, 0, N'Come here. ', 1),
       (414, 9, 1, N'I need you to get me the Violet Pill, thank you.', 1),
       (415, 0, 0, N'Since you killed the Kitfo Warrior, it seems', 1),
       (415, 0, 1, N'their Chief is wanting revenge on you.', 1),
       (415, 0, 2, N'Oh well, it''s just a bull anyway, haha.', 1),
       (415, 0, 3, N'There is a big rock on the left of the Reisuto ', 1),
       (415, 0, 4, N'River entrance, he is in there.', 1),
       (415, 0, 5, N'Subdue him and report to me.', 1),
       (415, 1, 0, N'There is a big rock on the left of the Reisuto ', 1),
       (415, 1, 1, N'River entrance, The Kitfo Alpha Male is in there.', 1),
       (415, 1, 2, N'Subdue it and report to me.', 2),
       (415, 1, 3, N'A bull is no big deal for you, right? Hahaha.', 1),
       (415, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (415, 1, 7, N'Mission target ''Kitfo Alpha Male'' appears in the', 1),
       (415, 1, 8, N'Reisuto River South <7125, 9995>.', 1),
       (415, 7, 0, N'Haha......sorry to trouble you.', 1),
       (415, 7, 1, N'Although it has some strength, it''s still just ', 1),
       (415, 7, 2, N'a bull. Haha... Here, take this ', 1),
       (415, 7, 3, N'Steel of Eternity. Haha....', 1),
       (415, 9, 0, N'Come here please.', 1),
       (415, 9, 1, N'A bull is trying to get the best of you?', 1),
       (415, 9, 2, N'Just kill it, a bull is no big deal for you,', 1),
       (415, 9, 3, N'right?', 1),
       (416, 0, 0, N'I know the last time you went to Yanggok Valley', 1),
       (416, 0, 1, N'you had some problems, am I right?  Well, don''t ', 1),
       (416, 0, 2, N'worry, if you go there now, things will be ', 27),
       (416, 0, 3, N'different.  You must go to the battle of Yanggok ', 27),
       (416, 0, 4, N'Valley and occupy the Yang Formation. Just ', 1),
       (416, 0, 5, N'do your best!  You need to occupy the position ', 1),
       (416, 0, 6, N'to win.  By the way, the Fujin, the ', 1),
       (416, 0, 7, N'Guanyin, and the Nangin will also ', 1),
       (416, 0, 8, N'be involved. You should take this seriously.', 1),
       (416, 0, 9, N' It will benefit us all if we win.', 1),
       (416, 1, 0, N'Yang Formation is the biggest Formation in ', 1),
       (416, 1, 1, N'Yanggok Valley. The occupyong Faction will get ', 1),
       (416, 1, 2, N'10% additional experience! Thats a very nice ', 1),
       (416, 1, 3, N'reward! Guanyin, Fujin, and Nangin are also ', 1),
       (416, 1, 4, N'involved, so you better take it seriously.', 1),
       (416, 1, 5, N'You will be greatly rewarded if we win.', 30),
       (416, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (416, 1, 7, N'Occupy the Yang Formation and hold it for 5', 34),
       (416, 1, 8, N'minutes. If we win, our Faction will get a 10% ', 34),
       (416, 1, 9, N'EXP bonus for 3 hours. The last standing Faction', 34),
       (416, 1, 10, N'will be the winner.', 34),
       (416, 1, 11, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (416, 1, 12, N'Yanggok Valley, Mogui Valley <1532, 9446>. ', 34),
       (416, 1, 13, N'Yanggok Valley, Rojiko Caverns <8768, 1679>', 34),
       (416, 7, 0, N'Haha, we won? That''s great!', 1),
       (416, 7, 1, N'I always believed in you!', 27),
       (416, 8, 0, N'Lost? It''s ok, we will make it next time,', 1),
       (416, 8, 1, N'just don''t lose your faith.', 1),
       (416, 9, 0, N'Come here please,', 1),
       (416, 9, 1, N'and join the battle of Yanggok Valley.', 1),
       (416, 9, 2, N'Take it seriously, because it would', 1),
       (416, 9, 3, N'benefit us all if we win.', 1),
       (417, 0, 0, N'You''re ready for the Chal Fi Grounds', 1),
       (417, 0, 1, N'battle...  From now on, the Nangin may be ', 1),
       (417, 0, 2, N'involved in every battle. This will make it more', 1),
       (417, 0, 3, N'risky, and the occupying method will have to ', 1),
       (417, 0, 4, N'change. Ok, prepare yourself, and watch out', 1),
       (417, 0, 5, N'for other enemies! When its time, talk to Tuo to ', 1),
       (417, 0, 6, N'go to Chal Fi Grounds. Let us fight ', 1),
       (417, 0, 7, N'together for honor and glory!', 1),
       (417, 1, 0, N'When its time, go to Chal Fi Grounds', 2),
       (417, 1, 1, N'by talking to Tuo. Be careful, it''s getting ', 2),
       (417, 1, 2, N'dangerous there.  You may give up if you''re ', 1),
       (417, 1, 3, N'too scared.', 1),
       (417, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (417, 1, 7, N'Chal Fi Grounds only level 106-112', 34),
       (417, 1, 8, N'citizens are allowed. A combat hotspot (hourly', 34),
       (417, 1, 9, N'battles) When the time comes, you may enter by ', 34),
       (417, 1, 10, N'Guard Captain Tuo or the prompt window. Hold ', 34),
       (417, 1, 11, N'the position for 5 minutes to win. ', 34),
       (417, 1, 12, N'There will be foes who can perform Area Attack.', 34),
       (417, 1, 13, N'This will make the battle unpredictable.', 34),
       (417, 1, 14, N'Always bear this in mind.', 1),
       (417, 7, 0, N'You''re becoming more famous, people from other', 1),
       (417, 7, 1, N'Factions have already heard of you, one day,', 1),
       (417, 7, 2, N'you will be even more famous than our Lord! ', 1),
       (417, 7, 3, N'Keep up the hard work!', 1),
       (417, 8, 0, N'That''s it, go back and have some rest.', 1),
       (417, 8, 1, N'I can count on others.', 1),
       (417, 9, 0, N'It''s just a fight like before,', 1),
       (417, 9, 1, N'but be aware of hidden enemies.', 1),
       (417, 9, 2, N'By the way, other Factions might give you ', 1),
       (417, 9, 3, N'some trouble as well...', 1),
       (418, 0, 0, N'Long time no see, you look even more fierce!', 1),
       (418, 0, 1, N'It seems you''re the best choice for this mission!', 1),
       (418, 0, 2, N'There are some creatures in the Reisuto River ', 1),
       (418, 0, 3, N'acting aggressively. Could you go finish off 60 ', 2),
       (418, 0, 4, N'Serpent Knights for me?  Go past Sumizo Palace ', 1),
       (418, 0, 5, N'and you''ll see the Reisuto River, they will be ', 1),
       (418, 0, 6, N'there, go kill them!', 1),
       (418, 1, 0, N'Some creatures in Reisuto River are acting ', 1),
       (418, 1, 1, N'aggressively.  Could you kill 60 Serpent Knights ', 1),
       (418, 1, 2, N'for me?  Go past the Sumizo Palace and you ', 1),
       (418, 1, 3, N'will see the Reisuto River, they will be there, ', 1),
       (418, 1, 4, N'go kill them!', 2),
       (418, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 30),
       (418, 1, 7, N'''Serpent Knights'' are in the Reisuto River to the', 34),
       (418, 1, 8, N'East - around <6525, 8049>', 34),
       (418, 1, 9, N'You will find them there.', 34),
       (418, 7, 0, N'What? Your kidding right? Your done?', 1),
       (418, 7, 1, N'That fast? Wow, I thought we would have to wait', 1),
       (418, 7, 2, N'until tomorrow... Well, hehe, the Nangin should ', 1),
       (418, 7, 3, N'be quiet for some time. Here, this Fortune Pouch', 1),
       (418, 7, 4, N'is for you.  Thank your for what you did today!', 1),
       (418, 9, 0, N'Hey it''s been a long time. I''m Guard Captain Tuo,', 1),
       (418, 9, 1, N'remember me?  I have mission for you again.', 1),
       (419, 0, 0, N'Haha, it''s been along time. Don''t you remember ', 1),
       (419, 0, 1, N'your little sister? I''m Fao.', 1),
       (419, 0, 2, N'I''m sorry, I lost something again, haha.', 1),
       (419, 0, 3, N'It''s a weapon called the Soul Capture Reaphook,', 1),
       (419, 0, 4, N'and it means a lot to me. It''s in the', 1),
       (419, 0, 5, N'hands of the Serpent Knights in the Itamo Hall.', 1),
       (419, 0, 6, N'Defeat the Serpent Knights and ', 1),
       (419, 0, 7, N'get it back for me.', 1),
       (419, 1, 0, N'Soul Capture Reaphook is in the hands of ', 1),
       (419, 1, 1, N'the Serpent Knights in Itamo Hall.', 1),
       (419, 1, 2, N'Defeat the Serpent Knights and you will get it.', 1),
       (419, 1, 3, N'Thank you, I know it''s troublesome.', 1),
       (419, 1, 6, N'** Reference Notes **', 34),
       (419, 1, 7, N'''Serpent Knights'' is in Itamo Hall North - ', 34),
       (419, 1, 8, N'<4672, 3736>.  ''Soul Capture Reaphook'' ', 34),
       (419, 1, 9, N'is a mission item, catch Serpent Knights  ', 34),
       (419, 1, 10, N'and it will appear. Please bring it back.', 34),
       (419, 1, 11, N'** Special Coordinates **', 34),
       (419, 1, 12, N'Itamo Hall route - Reisuto River <3779, 7009>', 34),
       (419, 1, 13, N'.', 1),
       (419, 7, 0, N'Hehe, I never lost faith in you,', 1),
       (419, 7, 1, N'Thank you so much.', 1),
       (419, 7, 2, N'I hope you will help me again in the future.', 1),
       (419, 8, 0, N'Even you think it''s too troublesome?', 1),
       (419, 8, 1, N'Oh... I''m so disappointed...', 1),
       (419, 9, 0, N'I''m Fao. Can you do a favor for me real quick?', 1),
       (419, 9, 1, N'Defeat the Serpent Knights in the Itamo Hall for', 1),
       (419, 9, 2, N'me.  They have taken my item, and it means ', 1),
       (419, 9, 3, N'a lot to me.  Please, you have to help me.', 1),
       (420, 0, 0, N'What are the Nangin thinking? It seems Ehlec ', 1),
       (420, 0, 1, N'Teroh wants to see you. Are you getting too ', 1),
       (420, 0, 2, N'famous? Aha...but you have to respect his power.', 1),
       (420, 0, 3, N'That would be awesome if we could have him ', 2),
       (420, 0, 4, N'on our side, haha. I know its dangerous, but you', 2),
       (420, 0, 5, N'have to face him. Find out what is he thinking.', 1),
       (420, 0, 6, N'He is waiting near the Kagirina River.', 1),
       (420, 0, 7, N'If you''re thinking you can take him.. Ha!', 1),
       (420, 0, 8, N'That''s almost impossible!', 1),
       (420, 0, 9, N'Right?', 2),
       (420, 1, 0, N'He is waiting somewhere in Goyu Village.', 2),
       (420, 1, 1, N'I know it''s dangerous, but you have to face him.', 1),
       (420, 1, 2, N'Find out what he is thinking.  If you think you', 1),
       (420, 1, 3, N'can take him.. Ha! Thats almost impossible!', 1),
       (420, 1, 4, N'** Reference Notes **', 1),
       (420, 1, 5, N'Mission target ''Guardian Ehlec Teroh'' is in ', 30),
       (420, 1, 6, N'Goyu Village entrance <8723, 13457>', 34),
       (420, 1, 7, N'He has a mighty defense and a powerful ', 34),
       (420, 1, 8, N'area attack.  Please bear this in mind.', 34),
       (420, 7, 0, N'Haha, I didn''t expect much,', 1),
       (420, 7, 1, N'After all, he is the most powerful of all the ', 1),
       (420, 7, 2, N'major Factions.  As long as he is not on the ', 1),
       (420, 7, 3, N'other two sides, we''ll be ok.  Hahaha.', 1),
       (420, 7, 4, N'I have to talk to our Lord, you get yourself ', 1),
       (420, 7, 5, N'healed.', 1),
       (420, 9, 0, N'Come over here. ', 1),
       (420, 9, 1, N'Nangins'' Lord, Ehlec Teroh, is waiting somewhere ', 1),
       (420, 9, 2, N'in Goyu Village. I don''t know what he wanted, ', 1),
       (420, 9, 3, N'but I believe he is going to test you. Try your', 1),
       (420, 9, 4, N'best, and get as much information as possible.', 1),
